<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="NUM" style="id">Ngamsung Vakna</book>
  <para style="h">Ngamsung Vakna</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ngamsung Vakna</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ngamsung Vakna</para>
  <para style="mt">Ngamsung Vakna</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel mite Egypt pan a pusua zawk a kum niina, a tha niina ni masabel ni in, Sinai Sennealngam sung tua mun Pathian ompuina Puanbuk sungah Topa in Moses paupui hi. Topa in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Nangma le Aaron in Israel mite ii bee le phungte le a innkuante zui in mihing simna nei tu nu hi. Pa a minpiang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />kum kul le a tungsia ngalkap seam thei tu peuma a min sazian la vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hong hu tu in bee le phung khat sung pan ukpi khat veu ngen tavun,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hi mihingte sia hi na seam tu in taangpite sung pan a kiteal minam lampuite ahi uh hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hi pasal sawm le niite ii huna taw Moses le Aaron in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />a tha niina, ni masabel ni in, taangpi bup sam a, bee le phungte le innkuante zui in mihing theampo tepteena lai vawt hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Topa thupiak bangin, kum kul le a tungsia pa peuma, kisimin a min kiciamtee hi. Sinai Sennealngam ah Moses in mihingte min tepteena lai vawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ngalkap na a seam thei tu kum kul pan a tungsia pa peuma bee le phungte le innkuante zui in min kikhum a, Jacob tapa lianbel Reuben minam taw kipan hi. A vekpi in a nuai a bang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Levi te sia nam dangte min kikhumna ah kihel ngawl hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />banghang ziam cile Topa in Moses tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />“Ngalkap na a seam thei tu mihingte na sim ciang, Levi namte kihelsak heak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Ahizong Levi te ka ompui na Puanbuk le a vanhzak nate theampo a uk tu in koi in. Amate in Puanbuk le a vanhte pua tu uh a, a sungah naseam in tua Puanbuk kiim ah ngiaphual saat tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Na ngiaphual na khiin simin Levi te in Puanbuk phel tu a, ngiaphual thak ah thua kik tu uh hi. Midang khat pawpo Puanbuk nai ah a pai le kithatlum tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />A taanglai Israel te in amate tek ii, laandial nuai ah a hon a hon in ngiaphual saat tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Khat po in puanbuk nai ah pai in a neak le ka thin uuk tu a, Israel taangpite daan ka pia tu hi, tua ahikom Levi te in Puanbuk kiim ah ngiaphual saatin cing tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Tuabangin Topa ii Moses a thupiakte theampo Israel mite in seam siat uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in Moses le Aaron tungah a nuai a bangin thupia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel te in ngiaphual a saat uh ciang a pawlkhenna sung tek le a bee le phung ii laandial nuai tek ah om tu uh hi. Puanbuk kiimkot ah a ngiaphual kisaat tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nisuana sang, Judah pawlkhen ii laandial nuai ah a omte in a lampuite khutnuai ah a nuai a bangin, a pawl a pawl in ngiaphual saat tu uh hi. Judah pawlkhen ah a omte pai masa tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thangsang Reuben ii laandial nuai ah a omte in a lampuite khutnuai ah a nuai a bangin, a pawl a pawl in ngiaphual saat tu uh hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuaciang a masa pawl niite le a nungsang pawl niite kilaklaw ah Levi mite in Puanbuk pua in pai tu uh hi. A pawl a pawlin amate laandial nuai tek ah ngiaphual saat in a om bangma in a pai ciang zong tuabang ma in pai tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nitumna sang, Ephraim pawlkhen ii laandial nuai ah a omte in a lampuite khutnuai ah a nuai a bangin, a hon a hon in ngiaphual saat tu uh hi: Ephraim pawlkhen ah a omte a thumna in pai tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Saksang Dan pawlkhen ii laandial nuai ah a omte in a lampuite khutnuai ah a nuai a bangin, a hon a honin ngiaphual saat tu uh hi. Dan ii pawlkhen ah a omte a khak belin pai tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Pawlkhen te sungah a pawl a pawl zui in, Israel mite kisim a, a vekpi 603,550 pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Moses tungah Topa thupiak sa bangma in Levi te sia Israel dangte taw kisim khawm ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tuabangin Moses tungah Topa thupiak sa theampo Israel mite in vawt siat uh hi. Amate sia a laandial nuai tek ah ngiakin, tuaciang amate bee le phung zui in pai uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hiteng sia, Topa ii Sinai Mual tungah Moses a paupui hun lai a, Aaron le Moses ii innkuanpuite ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aaron in tapa li nei a: a tapa lianbel Nadab hi a, Abihu, Eleazar le Ithamar te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amate thiampi suak tu in sathau kinoai a, thupha piak kipsakna a ngate ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahizong, Nadab le Abihu te sia Sinai Sennealngam ah a thiangtho ngawl meihal biakpiakna Topa tungah a piak ciang, kithatlum hi. Amate in ta nei ngawl ahikom Aaron nuntak hunsung teng Eleazar le Ithamar in thiampi na seam uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Levi minamte paipui in a, thiampi Aaron ii naseam tu in panmun pia in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate in keima ompuina Puanbuk atu in a kisamh bang le thiampite atu le taangpite atu a kisamh bang seam tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amate in Puanbuk sungah a om vanh theampo keamcing tu uh a, a taanglai Israel te atu in naseam tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Levi mite ii vaipuak sia Aaron le a tapate ii na a sepsak tu bek ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thiampi na a seam tu in Aaron le a tapate nasep na pia tu a; midang khat pawpo hi na a seam nuam sia kithatlum tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Tu in Levi mite keima aa hi tu hi. Egypt te ii taciil theampo ka thalup lai in Israel te innkuan tek pan tapa upabel le a ngannote sung pan a suakciil theampo keima atu in ka thiangthosak hi. Tu in Israel mite tapaciilte taangin Levi mite keima aa ahi hi; amate keima neisa hi tu hi. Keima in Topa ka hi hi.” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sinai Sennealngam ah Topa in Moses tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Levi mite ii bee le phungte le innkuante zui in, tha khat pan a tungsia a pha pa peuma a min la in tepteena vawt tu in sawl a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />a thupiak bangin Moses in seam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Levi in tapa thum nei a: Gershon, Kohath le Merari ahi hi. Tuate amate min a kivaw bee le phungte ii taanghpupite ahi hi. Gershon in tapa nii nei a: Libni le Shimei ahi hi; Kohath in tapa li nei a: Amram, Izhar, Hebron le Uzziel ahi hi; Merari in tapa nii nei a; Mahli le Mushi ahi hi. Amate sia amate min a kivaw innkuante ii taanghpupite ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Gershon ii bee le phung sia Libni innkuante le Shimei innkuante ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tha khat pan a tungsia a pha pa peuma kisim a, a vekpi in 7,500 pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hi bee le phung sia nitumna sang Puanbuk nungsangah ngiaphual saat tu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Lael tapa Eliasaph in bee le phung ii ukpi seam tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Amate in Puanbuk, a sungsang sitna, a puasang sitna, a sung tumna kongbiang puankhai,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />biaknatau le Puanbuk kiim kikhop na munah a om puankhakte le tuasia sung tumna kongkha puankhaite vaipuak la tu hi. Amate in hi nate taw a kipee-aw nasep theampo vaipuak la tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Kohath bee le phungte sia Amram innkuante, Izhar innkuante, Hebron innkuante le Uzziel innkuante ahi uh hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tha khat pan a tungsia pa peuma sazian kila a, a vekpi in 8,600 pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hi bee le phung te sia Puanbuk thang sangah ngiaphual saat tu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Uzziel ii tapa Elizaphan in bee le phung ukpi seam tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Amate in Thuciamna Thingkuang, Sabuai, meidetna khuam, biaknataute, Mun Thiangtho ah thiampite ii zak vanhte le Thiangthobel Mun sung tumna ah puankhai vaipuak la tu uh hi. Amate in hi nate taw a kipee-aw nasep theampo vaipuak la tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Levi mite ii ukpi sia thiampi Aaron tapa Eleazar hi. Ama sia Mun Thiangtho ah naseamte a ukpa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Merari bee le phung sia Mahli le Mushi innkuante a kingawm ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Kum khat pan a tungsia pa peuma sazian kila a, a vekpi in 6,200 pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Hi bee le phung sia Puanbuk saksang ah ngiaphual saat tu a, Abihail tapa Zuriel in bee le phung ii ukpi seam tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Amate in Puanbuk sakna thingpheakte, a zawlte, a khuamte, a tawdapte le a kipeepui theampo vaipuak la tu uh hi. Ama te in hi nate taw a kipee-aw nasep theampo vaipuak la tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Amate in khuamte, tawdapte, khetphinte le a puasang kikhopna mun atu khaute zongh vaipuak la tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Moses le Aaron le Aaron tapate in nisuana sang Puanbuk mai ah ngiaphual saat tu uh hi. Amate in Israel mite atu in Mun Thiangtho ah sep tu nasep theampo vaipuak la tu uh hi. Mihing khat pawpo tua nasep sep tu a sawm sia kithatlum tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Topa thupiak bangin Moses in Levi te bee le phung zui in tha khat pan a tungsia a pha pa peuma sazian la a, a vekpi in 22,000 pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah, “Israel te tapa a suakciil theampo keima aa hi. Tua ahiciang tha khat pan a tungsia Israel te tapa a suakciil theampo min tepteena lai vawt in. Ahizong amate tapa suakciil theampo taangin Levi te theampo keima aa ka suaksak hi! Keima in Topa ka hi hi! Tua banah nganno suakciil theampo taangin Levi te ngannote keima aa ka suaksak hi.” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Moses in a thu ni a, tapa suakciil tha khat pan a tungsia theampo sazian la in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />a vekpi kingawm in 22,273 pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />“Tu in Israel te tapa suakciil theampo taangin Levi te keima atu in hong aap ta'n a, Israel te nganno suakciil theampo taangin Levi te ii ngannote zongh hong aap ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Israel te tapa a suakciilte sia Levi te sangin 273 in tamzaw ahikom a vaal tapate lei kik nanak tu ni hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Biakbuk ah a kizangh ngeina om bangin tapa khat ciang ngunntang nga pia in a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />hi sumte Aaron le a tapate tungah pia in” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Moses in a thu ni a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />ngunntang 1,365 la in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Aaron le a tapate tungah pia hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Levi nam Kohath bee le phung ii a bawng le a innkuante zui in mi simna vawt tu le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa ompui na Puanbuk sungah naseam thei tu kum sawmthum le kum sawmnga kilaklaw pa theampo sazian la tu in sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A nasep sia a thiangthobel nate kihel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa in a nuai a bangin thuhilnate Moses tungah pia hi. Ngiaphual na phel tu uh hun a tun ciang Aaron le a tapate Puanbuk sungah tum tu a, Thuciamna Thingkuang mai ah a om puankhai la in tuasia taw tua Thingkuang siin tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amate in tuasia savun pha khat taw siin tu a, a tungbel ah vancii puan khat taw siinin, tua zawkciang a zawn natu thingpumte thun tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa tung anluum piakna sabuai tungah amate in vancii puan pha tu a tua tungah pakante, ngimnamtui bungte, biakpiakna kuangte le sapittui biakpiakna thawlte koi tu uh hi. Sabuai tungah anluum om tawntung tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amate in tuate theampo puansan khat taw siin tu a, savun pha khat taw tuate siin thua in, a zawn natu thingpumte thun tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amate in vancii puan khat la in, meiinnte taw meidetna khuam, taitee, kuangte le olive thau koina bung theampo siin tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amate in tuasia le a vanhte theampo savun pha khat sungah tunin puak natu thingzawl tungah koi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua zawkciang amate in vancii puan khat taw khamh biaknatau siin tu a tua tungah savun pha khat koi in, tuaciang zawn natu thingpumte thun tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amate in Mun Thiangtho ah a kizangh vanh theampo la tu a vancii puan khat taw tunin savun pha khat a tungah koi in tuaciang puakna tu thingzawl sia tungah tuate koi tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amate in sathau a nel vutte biaknatau pan luak tu a, a tungah puan sandup khat pha tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amate in biaknatau nasepna ah a kizangh vanhte: meihalna kuangte, thikkoaite, kawkeaute le kisilna kuangte theampo tua tungah koi tu uh hi. Tuaciang amate in savun pha khat tua tungah koi tu uh hi, tuaciang a zawnna thingpumte thun tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ngiaphual kiphel tu hun a cin ciang a thiangtho nate le vanhzakte theampo Aaron le a tapate in a sit zawkciang a pua tu in Kohath bee le phung pan hong pai tu uh hi. Kohath bee le phung in a thiangtho nate thutha ngawl tu a, a thutha le amate thi tu uh hi. Puanbuk a kikhiin simin hite sia Kohath bee le phung ii vaipuak ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Puanbuk bup le meidet tu sathau, ngimnamtui, antang biakpiakna, noi sathaute le Topa tungah a ki aapsa puanbuk sungah a om theampo thiampi Aaron tapa Eleazar ii vaipuak hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Topa in Moses le Aaron tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Kohath ii bee le phung sia
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />hi biakna taw kisai a thiangthobel nate nai ah a paina hu in thalup thuaksak heak in. Hisia a pian ngawl natu in Aaron le a tapate a sungah tumin, mi simin a sep tu te pia in, a vawt tu te son tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahizong Kohath mite puanbuk sungah tumin biakna taw kisai a thiangtho nate tua tu in a kithoai thiampite a mu le amate thi tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Levi nam Gershon bee le phungte a innkuan le a beete taw kizui in mihing simna vawt tu le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Topa ompui na Puanbuk sungah na a seam thei tu kum sawmthum pan kum sawmnga kilaklaw pa peuma sazian la in sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Amate in a nuai a vanhte puak tu vaipuak nei uh hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Puanbuk, a sung sitna, a pua sitna, a tung sitna a kipha savun, a sung tumna puankhai,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />biaknatau le puanbuk kiimkot ah a om kikhopna mun puankhakte le khauhualte, tuasia sung tumna puankhakte le tua nate thua natu vanhzakte theampo ahi hi. Amate in hi nate atu a kisamh theampo vawt tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Aaron le a tapate ii Gershon suante tungah puak tu le sep tu vaipuak a piak theampo a sep siat natu in Moses le Aaron in pha takin en tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hite sia Puanbuk sungah a sep tu Gershon bee le phungte ii vaipuak ahi hi; amate in tua nasepte thiampi Aaron tapa Ithamar ii thupiakna bangin seam tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah Levi nam Merari bee le phung ii bawngte le innkuante zui in mihing simna nei tu le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Topa ompui na Puanbuk sungah na a seam thei tu kum sawmthum pan kum sawmnga kilaklaw, pa peuma sazian la in sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Amate in puanbuk ii thingpheakte, zawlte, khuamte, le tawdapte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />tuaciang khuamte, tawdapte, khetphinte le puanbuk kiim kikhop na munah khaute, tuate taw a kizom nate theampo puak tu vaipuak nei uh hi. A puak tu vanhte mi simin vaipuak tekin nei tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hite sia Puanbuk sungah Merari bee le phungte ii vaipuak hi a: amate in thiampi Aaron tapa Ithamar thupiakna bangin seam tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Topa thupiakna taw kizui in, Moses, Aaron, le taangpi lampuite in Levi mi nam thumte ahi, Kohath, Gershon, le Merari suan teng a mihing simna nei hi, amate in Topa ompui na Puanbuk sungah na a seam thei tu kum sawmthum le kum sawmnga kilaklaw, pa peuma a bawngte le innkuante zui in sazian la a, a nuai a bang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah a thupiak bangin mi simin min sazian kila hi; Topa in Moses tungtawnin a thupiak bangin, a nasep tu le a puak tu vaipuakte mihing sim tungah kipia hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“A kiitakhuai vun natna veite ahibuale pumtung meima naai neite le mithi luang thamna taw a thiang ngawl peuma, ngiaphual pan a hawlkhiat natu in Israel mite thupia in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amate sungah ka teenna hi ngiaphual, a nitsak ngawl natu in biakna taw kisai a thiang ngawl hi mihingte theampo hawlkhia in,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Israel te in thu ni a, tua mihingte ngiaphual pan hawlkhia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Israel te atu in a nuai a kihilnate pia hi. Mihing khat pawpo in Topa tungah thumaan ngawlin khat pawpo tungah khialna a vawt ciang
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />a thuak pa tungah a mawna pualaak hamtang in, a maw a khial man a cingin a liau zawkciang zakhat tungah kul veu belapin pia thua tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahizong tua pa thi zo a, a liausum piak natu in mealheak nai a nei bua ahile, tua liausum sia thiampipa atu in Topa tungah kipia tu hi. Hi liausum sia, a maw a khialpa biakna taw kisai in thiansua natu a kizangh tuutal belapna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Israel te ii Topa tungah a tuam vilvel in a piak letsongte zongh tua letsong a saang thiampipa ii neisa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thiampi khat simin ama tungah a kipia biakpiaknate keam tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Israel te tungah a nuai a kihilna teng a piak tu in sawl hi. Tua thu sia pasal khat in ama tungah a zi thumaan ngawl a, pasal dang khat taw khialin ama pumpi ninsak ci a, muang la hi. Ahizong a khial laitak a kiman hi ngawl, tetti om ngawl a — a zi zongh in iim thei ahikom a pasal in thiang takin tel ngawl hi. Tua ahibuale hi thu sia a zi in thumaan ngawlna nei ngeingawl napi, a pasal in muang la thawthong zongh hi thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hi bang thu khat sasang a piang le, a pasal in a zi sia thiampipa kungah paipui tu hi. A pasal in biakpiak natu in a kisamh mangtaang vui kilogramme khat keng tu a, ahizong olive thau ahibuale ngimnamtui khat pawpo a tungah buak ngawl tu hi, banghang ziam cile hi biakpiakna sia a muang la pasal in thumaan thutak a heak nop manin a piak biakpiakna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Thiampipa in tua numei, mai ah paipui in biaknatau mai ah dingsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Thiampipa in leibeal sungah tui thiangtho tawm sung tu a, Topa ompui na Puanbuk sung suat tungah a om leivui tawm la in, tua tui a kha a sua natu a sungah tha tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuaciang thiampipa in numei ii sam phelsak tu a, tua numei khut sungah biakpiakna anvui koi tu hi. Thiampipa in a khut sungah haamsiatna tuikhaa a om beal sia toai tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuaciang thiampipa in tua numei ii thukimna la in, “Na pasal na palngul bua ahile hi haamsiatna tui neakna taw ngim na thuak buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahizong na pasal na palngul ahile,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Topa in na min sia na mite sungah haamsiatna khat suaksak tahen. Topa in na numei thilte kinsakin, na ngil puaksak tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hi tui na ngil sungah tum a, na ngil khangin, na numei thilte kinsak hen” ci in kiciamna vawtsak tu hi. Tua numei in, “Ka thukim hi; Topa in tuabang vawt tahen,” ci kik tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuaciang thiampipa in hi haamsiatna teng lai taw at tu a, tua tuikhaa beal sungah sil tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua tui sia numeinu ngil sungah a bot mama natna a piangsak thei tu in a neaksak ma in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />thiampipa in numei nu khut sungah a om biakpiakna anvui sia la tu a, Topa tungah aapin, biaknatau tungah koi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuaciang biakpiakna khat hi a cina in thiampipa in anvui khutdim khat la tu a, biaknatau tungah hal tu hi. A khakbel in tua tui sia numei in nesak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua numei in a pasal a palngul le tua tui in a bot mama natna piangsak tu a; a ngil khangin, a numei thilte kin tu hi. A min sia a mite sungah haamsiatna suak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ahizong tua nu a khial buale bangma tat ngawl tu a, nau nei thei tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hi thu sia a zi in hong palngul hi ci in thuum a, a muang la pasal khat ii thute ah zui tu thukham ahi hi. Tua numei sia biaknatau mai ah kidingsak tu a, thiampipa in hi a zeksa teng seam tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hi khialna pan a pasal suakta tu a, ahizong tua numei a khial le a piang babang a thuak kul tu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />a nuai a kihilnate Israel mite a piak tu in thupia hi. Pa ahizong numei ahizong Nazirite mi suak tu khi hi, ci in kiciamna nei a, Topa tungah a ki aap sia in
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />sapittui le kham thei ngui theite ten tu hi. Ama in sapitnga taw dawn tu a kivawt bangma dawn ngawl tu a, sapitnga sia a hingin ahizong a ko in ahizong ne ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in Nazirite te ahi hun sungin sapitkung pan a piang peuma, sapit mu le a haw dong ciangin ne ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama in Nazirite kiciamna nuai ah a om hun sung theampo a sam meet ngawl tu a, a mul meet ngawl tu hi. Ama Topa tungah a kipiak hun a cin dong kiciamna in heencip ahikom a sam le a khamul hoai tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama sam sia Pathian tungah ki aapna lim hi a, tua ahiciang mithi luang kung, a nu a pa, a suapuite luang ahi hial zong a neak na taw in ama le ama kininsak ngawl het tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama in Nazirite te ahi laiteng Topa tungah a kipum aap ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thakhat thu in a thi pa khat ii kungah a om hu in Nazirite pa in a kipum aap sa, a sam a ninsak le ni sali sung ngak nanak tu a, tua zawkciangin a sam le a khamul meet tu hi; tuabangin ama biakna taw kisai a thiang suak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ni liat ni in ama in Topa ompuina Puanbuk sung tumna ah a om thiampipa kungah inn vakhu nii ahi buale ngam vakhu nii paipui tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thiampipa in khat sia mawphel biakpiakna in, a dang khat sia meihal biakpiakna in nei tu a, mithi luang tham ahikom ama thiansua natu in a zeksa teng vawtsak tu hi. Tua ni ma in, ama in a sam pum aap kik tu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nazirite ahi na bangin Topa tungah amate hun sia aap kik tu hi. A masa hun teng kisimsak ngawl tu hi, banghang ziam cile a aapsa ama ii sam sia ninsak hi. Ama in khialphel biakpiakna in kum khat a pha tuu khat keng tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nazirite khat a kiciam hun a cin ciang ama in a zeksa teng vawt tu hi. Ama in Puanbuk tumna ah pai in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />a mealhem ngawl nganhing thum Topa pia tu hi: meihal biakpiakna in kum khat a pha tuutalno khat, mawphel biakpiakna in kum khat a pha tuula khat, pawlkhop biakpiakna in tuutal khat hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama in tol saw ngawl anluum law khat : olive thau taw hel in a vawt, anluum saate, olive thau noai in a paa in a vawt anluumte le a kisamh antang le sapittui taw biakpiaknate zongh pia lai tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Thiampipa in hi teng theampo Topa kungah paipui tu a, mawphel biakpiakna le meihal biakpiakna pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ama in pawlkhop biakpiakna in tuutal khat sia Topa tungah anluum law khat taw pia tu hi; ama in antang le sapittui biakpiakna zongh pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Puanbuk tumna ah tua nazirite in a sam meet tu a, pawlkhop biakpiakna a kihalna mei tungah tuasia hal tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuaciang thiampipa in a kihuan tuutal liang la tu a, anluum saa khat le law sung pan muhphaang khat taw Nazirite ii khut sungah piakhawm tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuasia zawkciang thiampipa in tua teng Topa tungah a tuam vilvel letsong in pia tu hi; tuate thiampipa atu in a thiangtho biakpiakna hi a, thukham om bangin thiampipa ii neisa tuutal phei le a awmsa belapna ahi hi. Tua zawkciang Nazirite in sapittui ne thei tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hite Nazirite mite zui tu ngeina hi a; ahizong Nazirite khat in a kulza sangin a tamzaw piak tu in kiciamna a nei le ama kamciam piak bang linlian in cingsak hamtang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Aaron le a tapate in Israel mite thupha a piak ciang a nuai a kammalte a zak natu a sonsawn tu in thupia hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Topa in note thupha hong pia in, hong keamcing tahen;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Topa in no tungah dikna le cikna thiamna hong nei tahen;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Topa in note maipha hong pia in, thinnopna hong pia tahen;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuaciang Topa in, “Amate in Israel mite tungah thupha piakna in ka min a lo le, keima in amate thupha ka pia tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Moses in Topa ompuina Puanbuk sak a man ni in, ama in Puanbuk le a vanhte theampo le biaknatau le a vanhte theampo, sathau noai in aapna nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuaciang Israel minamte sung pan a lampui bee le phung ukpi te ahi, mihing simna ukte in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa tungah a biakpiaknate: leang luk le khuital sawm le ni, lampui nii ciang in leang khat veu le lampui khat ciang in khuital khat tek paipui uh hi. Amate in tuate a piak siat zawkciang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Puanbuk atu, nasepna ah zak tu in hi letsongte saang in a; tua teng amate nasepna tu taw kizui in Levi mite tungah pia in,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ahiciang Moses in leangte le khuitalte Levi te tungah pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama in leang nii le khuital li Gershon te tungah pia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />leang li le khuital liat Mera te tungah pia hi. Amate ii nasep theampo Aaron tapa Ithamar ukna nuai ah kiseam tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahizong Moses in Kohath te tungah leangte ahibuale khuitalte pia ngawl hi, banghang ziam cile amate ii kepcing a thiangtho vanhte a liangko tungah a puak kul hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Biaknatau aapna vawt natu in lampuite zongh in biakpiaknate paipui uh hi. Amate in a letsongte biaknatau ah pia tu in a kingin ciang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah, “Biaknatau aap natu in, lampuite khat in a letsongte ni sawm le ni nii hun sung ni sim pia tu hi ci in amate son in,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amate in piakkhiatnate a nuai a bangin pia uh hi: Khatsim ii a paipui biakpiaknate kibang siat hi: antang biakpiakna tu in biakinn ah a kizangh ngei khaikhin taw a kitee, kilogramme 1.5 a ngit ngunn khawbeam khat le gram 800 a ngit ngunn kuang khat ii dim sathau taw hel anvui; ngimnamtui taw a kidim gram 110 a ngit khamh pakan khat; meihal biakpiakna tu in khuital moi khat, tuutal khat le kum khat a pha tuuno khat; mawphel biakpiakna tu in keal khat; le pawlkhop biakpiakna tu in khuital nii, tuutal nga, keal nga, le kum khat a pha tuuno nga ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="84" style="v" />Lampui sawm le niite ii biaknatau aap natu a, a paipui biakpiaknate a vekpi in a nuai a bang ahi hi; - Ngunn khawbeam sawm le nii le ngunn kuang sawm le nii a kingawm in kilogramme 27.6 ngit hi. - ngimnamtui taw kidim khamh pakan sawm le nii hi a, a kingawm in kilogramme 1.32 ngit hi. - Meihal biakpiaknate atu in khuital sawm le nii, tuutal sawm le nii, le kum khat a pha tuuno sawm le nii, tua teng taw piakkhop tu antang biakpiaknate, - Mawphel biakpiaknate atu in keal sawm le nii, - Pawlkhop biakpiaknate atu in khuital 24, tuutal 60, keal 60, kum khat a pha tuuno 60.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="89" style="v" />Topa taw kipaupui tu in Puanbuk sungah Moses a tum ciang, Thuciamna Thingkuang sitna tungah a om Cherubim nii kilaklaw pan Topa paupuina ama in za hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Aaron in meiinn salite meikhuam tungah a koi ciang a maisang a taang tu in koi tahen ci in son in.” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aaron in a thu ni a, meikhuam ii maisang maingatin meiinnte koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah a laksa pianzia bangin tua meikhuam a dawn pan a bul dong a kiseak khamh taw kivawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Levi te sia Israel dangte taw khen in a, hi bangin thiansua in:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />thiansuana tui amate tungah the in a, a pum tung bup multe meet hen a, a puante a sawp natu sawl in. Tua sia ciang amate thiangtho tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua zawkciang amate in khuital moi khat le antang biakpiak natu a, a kisamh olive thau taw kihel anvuite kengsak in a; nangma in mawphel biakpiak natu in a dang khuital khat na keng tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuaciang Israel taangpi bup khawm in a, ka ompuina Puanbuk mai ah Levi te dingsak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Israel mite in Levi te lu tungah a khut uh nga tu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />tuaciang Levi te in ka na a sep thei natu in Israel te tung pan a tuam vilvel letsong bangin amate Aaron in keima tungah hong aap tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Levi te in khuital niite lu tungah a khut uh nga tu uh a; Levi te atu a zeksa thiansuana vawt natu in, khui khat mawphel biakpiakna in kipia tu a, a dang khat sia meihal biakpiakna in kipia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Levi te kei tungah a tuam vilvel letsong in hong aap ta'n a, Aaron le a tapate in amate uksak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Levi te sia keima aa ahi tu in Israel dangte tu a bangin khen in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Levi te thiansua in aapna na vawt zawkciang, amate Puanbuk sungah naseam tu in a kiphu a kilawmte suak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Israel te tapa suakciil theampo ii dinmun ah amate ka laaksa hi a, amate keima bek ii neisa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Egypt ah taciil theampo ka thalup lai in, Israel innkuan sim ii tapa lianbel tek le a nganhing suakciil theampo keima neisa in ka tuam koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tu in keima in Levi te sia Israel te taciil theampo taangin ka la hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Puanbuk sungah Israel te atu in naseam tu le Mun Thiangtho ah Israel te in hong neak a, ngimna a thuak thaak ngawl natu a dal tu in, Israel te sung pan letsong bangin Levi te sia Aaron le a tapate tungah ka pia hi.” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua ahiciang Topa in Moses a thupiak bangin, Moses, Aaron le Israel mite theampo in Pathian tungah Levi te aap uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Levi te amate le amate kithiansua in, a puante uh silthiang a, tua zawkciang Aaron in Topa tungah amate a tuam vilvel letsong in aap hi. Aaron in amate atu in kithiansuana a zeksa teng zongh vawtsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Levi mite taw kisai, Topa ii Moses tungah a thupiak theampo mipite in vawt siat hi. Tua hi a, Levi mite sia Aaron le a tapate khutnuai ah Puanbuk sung naseam tu in a kiphu a kilawm hong suak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Levi te a mi simin kum 25 a phak pan kipan keima ompuina Puanbuk sungah a vaipuakte seam tu uh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />kum 50 a phak ciang tawp tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua zawkciang ama in Puanbuk sungah a Levi mipuite ii nasep hu thei tu hi, ahizong ama tatakin seam ngawl het tu hi. Hi bangin Levi te ii nasep tu teng seesak tu ni hi.” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel mite Egypt a nusiat zawk a kum niina, tha masabel in Sinai Sennealngam ah Topa in Moses paupui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in, “Israel mite in sep tu le zui tu ngeina om bangin tu tha ni sawm le ni li ni, nitum ciang kipanin Paisan Poai vawt tu uh hi.” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ahikom, Moses in mipite tungah Paisan Poai vawt tu son a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />amate in Sinai Sennealngam ah tha masabel ni sawm le ni li ni nitakin, poai vawt uh hi. Topa in Moses tungah a thupiak bangin mihingte in vawt tu teng vawt siat uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahizong mihing pawlkhatte mithi luang tham a, biakna taw kisai in thiang ngawl ahikom tua ni Paisan Poai ah kihel thei ngawl uh hi. Amate in Moses le Aaron kungah pai a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Kote in mithi luang khat thamin, ka thiang bua uh hi, ahizong Israel dangte ii Topa tung biakpiakna ah banghang hong kihelsak ngawl nu ziam?” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Moses in, “ Topa tung pan sawlna thu ka nga dong ngak zii vun,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Israel mite tungah a son tu in, “Note khat po, ahibuale na suan na paalte ii mithi luang a tham hu in thiang ngawl a, ahibuale khual khuala haw in, ahihang Paisan Poai a siim nuam veve le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />tha khat zawkciang, a tha niina ni sawm le ni li ni, nitakin poai vawt thei tu nu hi. Tol saw ngawl anluum le antee khaa taw poai vawt vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A zingsang dongin anneakvaal koi heak vun a, tua a kingo nganhing ii ngute khat zongh thiaktan heak vun. Zui tu ngeina theampo om bangin Paisan Poai vawt vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahizong mihing khat po biakna taw kisai in thiang a, khual zongh haw ngawl napi Paisan Poai a vawt bua ahile ka mi khat in kingaisun nawn ngawl tu hi, banghang ziam cile a hunin biakpiakna hong piak ngawl hang ahi hi. Ama in a mawna hu in thuak nanak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Note sungah ngamdangmi khat in Paisan Poai a vawt nuam ahile sep tu le zui tu ngeina om theampo vawt tu hi. Ngamdangmi hikale ngamsung mi hikale a kuama po zui tu in a kibang thukham ahi hi,” ci in sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Topa ompuina Puanbuk a kisak ni in, meei hong kaai a Puanbuk tuamcip hi. Zan in tua meei sia mei bangin taang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua meei a kikhaangto simin Israel te in Puanbuk phel a, meei a tuaksukna munah Puanbuk sa kik uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Topa thupiak bangin mite in ngiaphual phelin, ama thupiak bangin ngiaphual saat uh hi. Puanbuk tungah meeikaai a taam laiteng tua ngiaphual sung ma ah amate taam uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Khuangei mama Puanbuk tungah meeikaai a taam ciang amate in Topa thu ni in kikhiin ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Khat vevei ni tawmvei sung bek Puanbuk tungah meeikaai om a; bangbang po hikale Topa thupiakna bangin amate taam a, ahibuale kikhiin uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Khat vevei nitak pan zingsang dong bek meei om a, meei a kilapto po ciang amate kikhiin uh hi. Meei a kilapto hun simin amate kikhiin tan uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ni nii ahizong, tha khat ahizong, kum khat ahizong, khuangei zaw ahizong, Puanbuk tungah meei a om laiteng, amate zongh kikhiin ngawl hi; ahizong meei a kilapto ciang amate kikhiin uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Topa ii Moses tungtawn a, a thupiak bang ni in, amate in ngiaphual saatna, ngiaphual phelna te seam uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mipite kikhop tu sapna le ngiaphual phel natu zaaksakna a zak tu in sek taw a kiseak ngunn taw lemle nii vawt in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lemlete nii, awsau in a kitum ciang keima ompuina Puanbuk tumna kongbiang, nangma kiimkot ah taangpi bup kikhawm tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahizong lemle khat bek a kitum le bee le phungte pan lampui teng bek nangma kiimkot ah kikhawm tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lemlete aw a tawngin a kitum ciang nisuana sangah ngiaphual a saat minamte kikhiin tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lemlete aw a tawngin nii veina a kitum ciang thangsang a om minamte kikhiin tu uh hi. Tua ahikom ngiaphual phel natu in lemle aw a tawngin kitum tu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />ahizong taangpi kikhop natu ahile aw sau in kitum tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aaron tapa thiampite in lemlete tum tu uh hi. “A nuai a ngeina sia maisang hun theampo ah zui tu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na ngam sungah ngal hong om ciang, no hong sim na ngalte do tu in ngal phawnna lemle na tum tu uh hi. Keima, Topa na Pathian in kong hu tu a, na ngalte khut sung pan kong ngum tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lungnop hunte sung zongh ah — na Thadet Poaite le a dang na biakna poaite ah — meihal biakpiaknate le pawlkhop biakpiaknate na piak uh ciang lemlete tum tu nu hi. Tuasia ciang no kong hu tu hi. Keima in Topa na Pathian ka hi hi.” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A mipite Egypt ngam a nusiat zawk a kum nii a tha niina, a ni kul ni in, Topa ompuina Puanbuk tung pan meei kilaamto a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Israel te a khualhawna kipanin Sinai Sennealngam pan pusuak uh hi. Tua meei sia Paran duisung ngampa ah tawlnga hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Moses tungtawn a, Topa thupiak bangin amate vaiding tu kipan a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />a kikhiin simin, tua a kizui ngeina om bangin ngamta uh hi. Judah nam ii lampuina laandial nuai ah a om khen khat sia Amminadab tapa Nahshon in uk a, a hon a honin pai masa uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Zuar ii tapa Nethanel in Issachar nam sia uk a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Helon ii tapa Eliab in Zebulun nam uk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuaciang Puanbuk phelin Gershon le Merari bee le phung in pua in pai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A zom ah, pawlkhenna laandial nuai ah a om Reuben namte sia Shedeur ii tapa Elizur in uk a, a hon a hon in pai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Zurishaddai ii tapa Shelumiel in Simeon nam uk a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Deuel ii tapa Elisaph in Gad nam uk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuaciang Levi nam Kohath bee le phung in a thiangtho vanhte pua in ding uh hi. Amate a Ngiaphual saa kik natu a thet hunin, Puanbuk saksa in om kik zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A zom ah pawlkhenna laandial nuai ah a omte sia Ephraim nam in lampui a Ammihud ii tapa Elishama uk a, a hon a hon in pai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Pedahzur ii tapa Gamaliel in Manasseh nam uk a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Gideoni ii tapa Abidan in Benjamin nam uk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A khakbel in pawlkhenna laandial nuai ah a omte Dan nam in lampui a, pawlkhen theampo ii a vaihuai seam a, Ammishaddai ii tapa Ahiezer in uk a, a hon a hon in pai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ochran ii tapa Pagiel in Asher nam uk a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Enan ii tapa Ahira in Naphtali nam uk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tu a bang teng sia, Israel te ngiaphual phel in a kikhiin simin a hon a honin a paizia ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Moses in Midian mi Jethro ii tapa, a zi ii suapuipa Hobab tungah, “ Topa ii piak tu hong cina munah kote a pai tu ka ahi uh hi. Ama in tu in Israel te a nuamsa tu in hong kamciam zo ahikom, hong zui ta'n, ka nopsaknate nang taw ih hawm khawm tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hobab in, “Hingawl hi, ka pianna ngam ah ka heak kik tu hi.” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Moses in, “Nong hesuakna taw kote hong nusia heak in. Duisung ngampa ah ko ngiaphual saat thei natu mun he na hi ciang kote lam hong lak thei tu ni hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ko hong zui lete Topa hong piak thupha theampo nang taw ih hawm tu hi.” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Israel mite in mual thiangtho ahi Sinai nusia a, ni thum sung pai uh hi. Topa Thuciamna Thingkuang sia ngiaphual mun tu a zong tu in amate mai ah paikhol tawntung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Amate ngiaphual khat sim pan a kikhiin laitak, sun hunin Topa ii meei amate tungah om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Thuciamna Thingkuang a din pui hun simin Moses in, “ Topa awng, tho in a; na ngalte kithethaangsak in, nang hong ngaimawte taisak in!” ci bul hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />A tawlngak hun simin ama in, “ Topa awng, Israel innkuan a tul sim te kungah hong heak kik ta'n,” ci bul hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mipite in amate ngimnate Topa tungah phun uh hi. Tua thu a zaak ciang Topa thin uuk a, amate tungah meikuang khiak hi. Amate sungah tua mei kuang a, ngiaphual mong khat kaanghtum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mipite in Moses tungah huna ngenin au a; Moses in Topa tungah thungen in tua mei mit hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ahikom tua mun Taberah kici hi, banghang ziam cile tua mun amate sungah Topa ii mei kuang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Israel te taw khual a haw khawm ngamdang mite pawlkhat om hi. Amate in sa lungngul mama uh a, Israel te ngawngawn zongh phun kipan in: “Neak tu sa tawm beak nei thei thong leang maw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Egypt ah man piak ngawlin ngasa theampo ih du bang po ih ne hi. Ih neak tawntung tangmaite, tangmaisante, lonamsiate, kaisonsante, kaisonkaangte phawk kik vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahizong tu in ih tha bo zo hi. Neak tu bangma om ngawl a — ni sim ni simin manna bebek hi!” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />(Manna sia thaicii no taw kibang a, a meal a kaang le a eng kithua bang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua mannate zan lai in ngiaphual tungah daaitui taw taak khawm hi. A zingsang ciang a mipite pai in tawm a, ngoaivui in ahibuale sum sungah suuvui hi, tua zawkciang huanin muhphaang in vawt uh hi. A limna olive thau taw a ki em anluum bangin lim hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mipite theampo a ngiaphual kongbiangte tek ah a hon a hon in ding in, a phun uh sia Moses in za hi. Amate tungah Topa thin uuk ahikom Moses a thinngim a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />ama in Topa tungah, “Banghangin kei hong vawtsia mama ni ziam? Banghangin kei tungah lungkim ngawl ni ziam? Banghangin hi mihingte theampo kei ii vaipuak laak tu in hong pia ni ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amate kei bitphua hi ngawl a, kei piansak le hi ngawl hi. Amate ii taanghpupite tungah na kamciamsa ngam sang paina lam tawntung ah nau omh khat bang ahi tu le amate nausen te bangin ka baan taw a toai tu in banghang kei hong sawl ni ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hi mihingte theampo khamkhop tu sa sia koisung pan nga thei tu khi ziam? Amate in sa hong ngenin phiing tawntung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Keima nguak in hi mihingte theampo atu vaipuak ka la thei bua hi; Kei atu in nasia leih hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hi bangin nong vawt tu ahile nong ngitlona ka thuak nawn ngawl natu in hong hesuak ta'n a kei hong that heu ta'n,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah, “Mipite lampui in a kiciamtee a zatak huai mihing sawmsali khawm in a, ka ompuina Puanbuk ah hong paipui ta'n, tua munah nangma kiim ah dingsak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kong paisuk tu a, tualai ah kong paupui tu hi. Nang kong piaksa thaa pawlkhat la in, amate ka pia tu hi. Tuasia ciang amate in hi mihingte atu vaipuak teng hong hu thei tu a, nangma bek in tua vaipuak na la buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tu in, mipite tungah son in, ‘Zing ciang atu in kithiansua tavun; neak tu sa na nei tu uh hi. Note phiingin sa tawm ne nuam ung ci in, Egypt ma nuamsa in na lungngulna thu uh Topa in za zo hi. Tu in, Topa in sa hong pia tu a, na ne tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Note in sa na ne tu uh a ni khat, ni nii, ni nga, ni sawm ahibuale ni kul sung bek zongh hi ngawlin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />tha khat bup na zaknop ngawl liang uh dong, na nim uh dongin na ne tu uh hi. Banghang hi bang hi tu ziam na ci uh le hilai note sungah a om Topa na nial uh a, Egypt ngam pan pusuak bualeang ci in na phunsan uh hang hi,’ ci in son in” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Moses in Topa tungah, “Hi sungah mihing 600,000 ka lampui a, tha khat sung a kham tu sa a kicing ka pia tu, ci ni ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Khui le tuute amate kham tu in ngo zo tu hi ziam? Tuipi sungah ngasa theampo amate atu in kicing tu ziam?” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Topa in, “Ka vaangletna a kiciangtan ziam? Ka ci bangin a pian le a pian ngawl hai ngawlin na mu tu hi!” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuaciang Moses pusuak in Topa ci teng mite tungah son hi. Ama in lampui 70 te kaikhawm in Puanbuk kiim ah omsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuaciang Topa meei sungah tuaksuk in Moses paupui hi. Ama in Moses tungah a piaksa thaa pawlkhat la in, lampui 70 te tungah pia hi. Amate tungah tua thaa a pai ciang kamsaangte bangin amate au uh a, ahizong khuangei au ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Lampui sawmsalite sung pan niite ahi, Eldad le Medad in Puanbuk ah pai ngawlin ngiaphual ah om uh hi. Tua ngiaphual ah amate tungah thaa pai a, amate zongh kamsaangte bangma in a au uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tangvalno khat sia, Eldad le Medad omdan teng Moses tungah son tu in tai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuaciang a no lai panin Moses a hu tawntung pa Nun tapa Joshua pau in Moses tungah, “Topa awng, amate tawlngasak in!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Moses in, “Kei ngaisut tu teng hong thinnuammaw ni ziam? Topa in a mite theampo tungah a thaa pia in, kamsaangte bangin amate theampo ausak le ka uuk hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuaciang Moses le Israel lampui 70 te ngiaphual ah cia kik uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Topa in thakhat thu in tuipi pan vamimte a puak vui vasak a, tua vamimte lei pan meter khat sangin a niamzaw in leang hi. Vamimte ngiaphual tung le a kiim a paam kilometre tam mama sung teng ah om uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tua hi a, mipite in tua ni bup, zankhuateak le a zing ciang sunkhua in vamim man uh a; kilogramme tulkhat nuaisia a man om ngawl hi. Amate in vamimte ngiaphual kiimkot theampo ah a ngeam tu in pho uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Vamim sa neak tu tam mama a nei lai hun sung ma in, mipite tungah Topa thin uuk ahikom amate sungah a kilaw thei natna tungsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tua munah sa du in a longthak mi tam mama phum ahikom tua mun sia Kibroth Hattaavah (a khiakna “Longthakte Thaan”) kici hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Mipite tua mun pan Hazeroth ah kikhiin a, tualai ah ngiaphual saat uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Moses in Cush mite numei khat teenpui a, tua hu in Miriam le Aaron in sonsia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amate in, “ Topa in Moses tungtawn bekin thuson ziam? Eite tungtawn zong thuson hi ngawl ziam?” ci uh hi. Amate cisia Topa in za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />(Moses sia a kiniamkhiak mihing hi a, leitung ah a om midang khat pawpo sangin kiniamkhiak zaw hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thakhat thu in Topa in, Moses, Aaron le Miriam paupui a, “Note thum keima ompuina Puanbuk ah hong pai tavun,” ci hi. Amate pai a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />tuaciang Topa sia meeikhuam khat sungah tuaksuk a, Puanbuk kongbiang ah dingin, “Aaron awng! Miriam awng!” ci in sam hi. Amate nii mai sangah pai a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />tuaciang Topa in, “Tu in kong thuson tu te ngai vun! Note sungah kamsaangte a om ciang, keima le keima amate kungah mukholnate sung pan ka kilangh a, mangte sung pan amate ka paupui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka naseampa Moses taw ka kipaupui ciang sia a tuamdang khat ahi hi; Israel ka mite theampo ama in ka uksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ahikom ama taw kimaingat in kam soaiheamte zangh ngawlin thiang takin ka paupui hi; a ma in ka pianlim ngawngawn hong mu hi! Ka naseampa Moses langpanin bangbang pau ngam nu ziam?” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amate tungah Topa thin uuk hi; tua hi a ama in a paisat po ciang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Puanbuk pan meei in nusia a, Miriam vun tungah thakhat thu in a kiitakhuai natna theng in, vuuk bangin hong kaang hi. Miriam sia hi natna taw a kituamcip Aaron in a mu ciang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />ama in Moses tungah, “Ka topa awng, a mawmawthuai ka mawna uh hangin hesuakna taw hi bang daan hong thuaksak heak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A thisa in a suak, a taksa a lang a kine khawng khat bangin ama suaksak heak in” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ahiciang Moses in Topa biakpui a, “Pathian awng, Miriam damsak in!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Topa in, “Tua nu maitang ah a pa in cil a phii le ama in ni sali sung maizum thuak tu hi. Tua ahikom ama sia nipi khat sung ngiaphual pua sangah kikoi tu a, tuasia zawkciang ngiaphual sungah kitumpui kik thei tu hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Miriam sia ngiaphual pua sangah ni sali sung kikoi a, ama a kitumsak kik mateng mipite kikhiin ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua zawkciang amate in Hazeroth nusia in, Paran duisung ngampa ah ngiaphual saat uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“A minam sawm le niite ii lampuite sung pan khat tek veu teal in a, thudawpkute bangin Israel te ka piak Canaan ngam a vil tu in paisak in,” ci hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Moses in a thu ni a, a nuai a lampuite Paran duisung panin paisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hi teng sia Moses ii a ngamvil tu in a sawl thudawpku teng ahi hi. Ama in Nun tapa Hoshea sia Joshua ci in a min laih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Moses in amate a paisak ciang, amate tungah, “Hi sung pan saksang zuanin Canaan ngam thang sangah pai tavun a, tuaciang mualtung ngam ah pai tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A ngam sia bangbang ngam hi a mihing bangza teang a, bangza thahat ziam cite hong tel tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A ngam pha ziam sia ziam, mite a dongdai khuate sungah teangzau ziam, a muanhuai a ki uum khuapite sungah teang ziam cite hong kantel tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A lei pha ziam, thingkung tamna taamngam ahi ziam hong en tavun. Tualai ah a ciin thingno nga pawlkhat hong ciapui nanak tavun,” ci in vaitha hi. (Tua hun sia sapit min tu kipat laitak ahi hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuaciang, thangsang ngam Zin duisung ngampa pan, amate saksang zuanin, saksang ah a om Hamath Mualciangh nai Rehob dong ngamvil in pai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Amate thangsang ngam tengah pai masa a, Anakim a kici mihing thatang lian nam ii suan le paal ahi, Ahiman, Sheshai le Talmai bee le phung teng teenna Hebron theng uh hi. (Hebron sia Egypt ngam Zoan khua saat ma kum 7 lai in kisaat hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Amate Eshcol Kuam theng a, tua munah amate in sapit bom khat a nga sapitbaak khat saattan in, ngit mama ahikom mol thaakin mihing nii in zawng liang uh hi. Amate in talee nga le theinga pawlkhat zongh ciapui uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />(Tua mun sia Israel te ii sapitnga bom a saattanna mun ahikom Eshcol Kuam kici hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ni sawmli sung ngam a vil zawkciang, thudawpkute sia,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Moses, Aaron le Israel taangpi bup omna Paran duisung ngampa Kadesh ah heak kik uh hi. Amate ii a mu bang teng son in, a thingnga puakte lak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Amate in Moses tungah, “Kote in ngam ka vil uh a, a hauna le a lei phatnate ka mu uh hi; a thingnga pawlkhat zongh hilai ah kong ciapui uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ahizong tualai ah a teang mite hat mama uh a, a khuapite lian mama in kul taw pha takin ki uum hi. Tua sangin zongh a poizaw sia thatang liante ii suan le paalte tua munah ka mu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Thangsang ngam ah Amalek te teang a, Hit te, Jebus te, le Amor te mualtung ngam ah teang a; Canaan te ahile Mediterranean tuipi hui le Jordan ngundung ah teang uh hi,” ci in son uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Caleb in Moses langpanin a phunsan mipite thimsak a, “Tu in eite in simin a ngam la tawng; tua ngam a zo zo tu in ih tha hat khop hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ahizong Caleb taw a paikhawm pasalte in, “Hi ngawl hi, amate sim tu in ih thahat tham ngawl hi; eite sangin tualai ah a om mite thahat zaw hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tua ahiciang amate in a ngam vilna thute ahi ngawl lamin Israel te sungah zelsak uh hi. Amate in, “Tua leitang pan tua munah a teang sa mihingte neakkhop tu ngawngawn zongh an piang ngawl hi. Ka mu uh mihingte theampo sia saang mama a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Anak suan le paal, mihing thatang liante ngawngawn ka mu uh hi. Eite sia khaumaw bang lelin no ih kisa a, amate muna zongh ah tuabang lel ma ih hi tu hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mipite lungmang a thinkiam in zankhuateak kap in au hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amate in Moses le Aaron langpanin phunsan uh a, “Egypt ah ahibuale hi lai duisung ngawngawn ah thi le ung phazaw hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Banghangin eite tua ngam ah Topa in hong paipui ziam? Eite ngal sungah hong kithat tu a, ih zite le ih tate kiman tu hi. Egypt ah cia kik leang phazaw ngawl ziam?” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ahiciang amate khat le khat tungah, “Lampui khat tealin Egypt ah cia kik tawng!” kici uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Moses le Aaron sia mihonpite mai lei ah kun uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaciang Nun tapa Joshua le Jephunneh tapa Caleb, thudawpkute sung pan nii in khuangaina taw a puante balkeak in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />mipite tungah, “Ka ngam vilna uh leitang sia leitang pha mama khat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Eite tungah Topa hong lungkim pole ama in tua munah hong paipui tu a, tua ngampha le ngamnuam hong pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa leedo heak vun a, tualai a teang mihingte kiita heak vun. Eite in olno takin amate ih zo tu hi. Eite taw a omkhawm Topa in amate a dal a pathiante zo zo a; tua ahikom lau heak vun,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Taangpi buppi in Joshua le Caleb suang taw denlup tu in tawng uh hi, ahizong Topa ompuina khuavak taang velvol sia Puanbuk tungah thakhat thu in kilangh sia, mipite in mu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah, “Hi mipite in bang tanvei kei hong nial lai tu ziam? Amate sungah nalamdang lakna tam mama vawt zo napi, hong muang ngawlin bang tanvei hong nial tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A kilaw thei natna puakin amate ka mon tu a, ahizong nang sia amate sangin a lian zaw le a thahat zaw minam khat ii pa in kong vawt tu hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahizong Moses in Topa tungah, “Nangma vaangletna taw hi mipite Egypt pan na pusua pui hi. Na mihingte tungah na nasepnate Egypt te in a zaak uh ciang, amate in
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />hi ngam a teang mite tungah son tu uh hi. Topa , nangma in kote taw nong om a, kote tungah na meei a tawlngak ciang in, thiang sitset a hong kimu na thu le sun in meeikhuam taw, zan in meikhuam taw ka mai uh ah na pai na thute hi mite in za siat zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tu in na mite theampo thatlum thong lete na minthanna a za sa minamte in
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />a Pathian ii piak tu a, a khapsa ngam ah a mite then zo ngawl ahikom duisung ah thatlum hi hong ci tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ahiciang, tu in Topa awng thu kong ngen hi, na vaangletna hong lak ta'n a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />‘Keima Topa sia thin uuk hak a, itna lian le thumaanna a lak, mawna le leedona a maisakpa ka hi hi. Ahizong a pate mawna hangin tate le tute tungah khang thum, khang li dongin daan ka pia tu hi’ ci in nong ciamsate taangtungsak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuaciang tu in Topa awng, a kikheal ngawl a lian, na itna taw kizui in Egypt ngam pan na pusuapui a kipan a mawna na maisak bangin, hi mite mawna na maisak natu in thu kong ngen hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Topa in, “Nong nget bangma in amate mawna ka maisak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahizong keima in a nungta takpi Pathian ka hi a ka ompuina in leitung theampo a dim takpi bangin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />hi mite khat zongh Canaan ngam tum tu in nungta ngawl tu hi cisia kong kamciam hi. Amate in ka ompuina khuavak taang velvol sia le Egypt ngam le duisung ah nalamdang lakna ka vawtte mu zo napi ka thu ni nuam ngawlin hong nial a, pehial pehial in ka thin uai na hong ze et uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A taanghpupite tungah ka khapsa ngam ah amate tum ngeingawl tu hi. Kei hong nial peuma in tua ngam ah tum ngeingawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ahizong ka naseampa Caleb ii khuangaisutna sia a tuam hi a, kei tungah thumaan lai ahikom a ngam vilna leitang ah ka paipui tu a, tuaciang a suan a paalte in
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Amalek te le Canaan te ii tu a, a teenna ngamkuamte lua tu hi. Zing ciang heak kik vun a, Aqaba Tuipidok sang duisung ah pai vun,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Topa in Moses le Aaron tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Hi mihing seksolte in bang tanvei kei hong phunsan lai tu ziam? Hong phutsatnate ka zaak tam zo hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tu in amate tungah, ‘Keima in a nungta takpi Pathian ka hi bangma, nong nget uh bangin kong pia tu hi, ci in ka kiciam hi. Keima Topa pau zo khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Na thi tu uh a, hi duisung ngampa ah na luangte kithethaang tu uh hi. Kei nong phunsan uh hu in, note kum kul tungsia peuma, tua ngam ah tum ngawl tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Teangsak tu in kong kamciamsa ngam ah Joshua le Caleb simngawl note khat zongh na teang buatu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Na tate kiman tu na ci uh hi, ahihang na nialna ngam ah amate ka paipui tu a, tua ngam sia amate inn le lo suak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Note sia hi lai duisung ah na thi tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Note na thi siat uh dong na thumaan ngawlna uh hangin ngimthuak in na tate uh duisung ah kum sawmli sung vakthap tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Na ngamvil uh ni phaza, ni khat ciang kum khat, ni sawmli atu kum sawmli sung note in na mawna thaman na thuak dipdeap tu uh hi. Kei in no kong langpan ciang bangbang hi ziam ci sia na he tu uh hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Kikaikhawm in kei hong langpan no mi seksolte tungah hisia kong tungsak tatak tu hi, ci in ka kiciam hi. Hi lai duisung ah note theampo thi siat tu nu hi. Keima, Topa pau zo khi hi,’ ci in ka zona teng na son in,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Moses ii ngamvil tu a, a sawl mihingte ii thumaan ngawl a son kikna in mipite ii Topa a phutsatna piangsak hi. Tua hu in, Topa in amate tungah natna tungsakin thi tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Thudawpku sawm le niite sung pan Joshua le Caleb bek suakta uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Moses in Topa thusonte Israel te tungah a son ciang, amate nasia takin khuangai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Mualtung ngam la tu in a zing ciang zingtuungin amate kipan a, “Tu in Topa hong sonsa ngam ah pai tu in ih kinging hi. Mimaw mikhial hi hing ci in ih pualaak hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Ahizong Moses in, “Tua ahile banghangin tu ciang Topa thu ni ngawl nu ziam? Zo ngawl tu nu hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Pai heak vun, note taw Topa omkhawm ngawl a, na ngalte in hong zo tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Amalek te le Canaan te taw na kisim uh ciang ngal sungah na thi tu uh hi; Topa sia note taw omkhawm ngawl tu hi, banghang ziam cile ama nung zui tu na nial zo uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Topa Thuciamna Thingkuang ahizong, Moses ama mama ahizong ngiaphual nusia ngawl napi amate sia mualtung ngam ah kaato ngam veve lai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tuasia ciang, tualai ah a teang Amalek te le Canaan te in amate simin zo a, Hormah dong zuizen uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah, a piak tu ngamsung ah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel mite ii zui tu in a nuai a ngeinate pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Meihal biakpiakna, kiciamna taangtutna biakpiakna, thinzaw biakpiakna ahibuale a hun zui a na vawt biakna poaite biakpiakna ah ngaw tu in khuital khat, tuutal khat, tuu khat ahibuale keal khat Topa tungah kipia thei tu hi; hi an taw biakpiaknate ii ngimnamtui sia in Topa lungkimsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Meihal biakpiakna in tuu ahizong keal ahizong Topa mai ah a pia pawpo in antang biakpiakna ah nganno khat ciang olive thau litre khat taw a kihel anvui kilogramme khat, sapittui litre khat taw paipui khawm tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuutal khat a kipiak ciang, antang biakpiakna in olive thau litre khat le lang taw a kihel anvui kilogramme nii
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />le sapittui litre khat le lang taw pia khawm tu hi. Hi sangaw biakpiaknate ii ngimnam in Topa lungkimsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Meihal biakpiakna ahibuale, kiciamna taangtunna biakpiakna ahibuale pawlkhop biakpiakna in Topa tungah khuital khat a kipiak ciang
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />antang biakpiakna in olive thau litre nii taw a kihel anvui kilogramme thum,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />le sapittui litre nii taw kipia khawm tu hi. Hi sangaw biakpiakna ngimnam sia in Topa lungkimsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Biakpiakna in khuital khat, tuutal khat, tuu ahibuale keal khat taw tuabangin piakhawm tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nganhing khat sang a tamzaw a kipiak ciang nganhing a phaza zui in vanh dangte zongh kikhan to tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Israel mi tatak theampo in a ngimnam taw Topa lungkim na ahi, an taw biakpiakna a nei ciang tuabangin seam tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ngamdangmi khat note sungah tawmvei sung ahizong a tawntung ahizong a teang pa in hun khat pawpo ah Topa ii a ngim dik a sak an taw biakpiakna a nei le tua ngeinate ma zui tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Noma na hi uh zong, note sungah hong teang ngamdangmite ahizong, hi ngeinate ma maisang hun theampo ah zui tu hi. Note le amate Topa muna ah a kibang na hi uh a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />thukhamte le ngeinate a kibang ma in note le amate zui tu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Topa ii a piak tu ngamah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Israel mite ii zui tu a nuai a ngeinate Topa in Moses tungah pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ngam pan a piang ante a neak uh ciang pawlkhat sia Topa aituam atu in kikoituam tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Anthak na laak uh ciang anluum na em maksakbel uh sia Topa tungah a tuamin kipia tu hi. Na ancilna sung pan antang na piaktuam bangin hisia kipia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na anluum emte sung pan hi a tuam vilvel letsong sia Topa tungah maisang hun theampo ah kipia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahihang Topa in Moses tungah a piak zui tu ngeina pawlkhat sia, mihing khat po in a zui ngawl thaak ciang ahizong,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Topa ii Moses tungtawn a, a thupiak theampo sia maisang ah Israel taangpi taangta te in a zui ngawl hun om tu in ngaisun tawng,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />taangpite ii a heak ngawlna hu in, tuabang khial tha ahile amate in meihal biakpiakna, Topa a lungkimsak ngimnamtui, antang biakpiakna le sapittui biakpiakna taw in khuital khat pia tu hi. Amate in mawphel biakpiakna in kealtal khat pia thua tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Thiampipa in taangpite atu in a zeksa thiansuana vawt tu a, amate khialna kimaisak tu hi, banghang ziam cile vawt thaak khialna hi a, amate in Topa tungah an taw biakpiakna khat bangin mawphel biakpiakna hong paipui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Israel taangpi bup le amate sungah a teang ngamdangmite a vekpi in a khialna kimaisak tu hi, banghang ziam cile tua vawt thaak khialna sungah mihing theampo kihel siat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mihing khat in ama aituamin mawna khialna a vawt tha ahile, ama in mawphel biakpiakna in kum khat a pha kealla khat pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Thiampipa in biaknatau ah tua pa a mawna a khialna pan thiansua natu in a zeksa thiansuana teng vawt tu a, tuaciang ama ii mawna khialna kimaisak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hi ngeina sia Israel mi tatak te ahizong, ngam sungah a teang ngamdangmite ahizong, a kuama po in mawna khialna khat a vawt thaak ciang zui tu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ahizong ngammi ahizong, ngamdangmi ahizong mawna khialna a vawt kaltangte sia Topa a thusim ngawl mawna a nei hi a, kithatlum tu hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />banghang ziam cile ama in Topa ci bang nialin a thupiakte khat a palsat kaltang hang ahi hi. A thina in ama kivawt ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Khatvei, Israel te duisung ngampa ah a om lai in pasal khat Sabbath ni in thingtom kimu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ama sia Moses, Aaron le taangpi bup mai ah kipaipui a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />ama bangbang vawt tu ci, kihe thiang ngawl ahikom thong sungah kikoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Topa in Moses tungah, “Hi sia pa thisak kul tu hi; ama ngiaphual pua sangah taangpi bup in suang taw deanglum tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Topa thupiak bangin taangpite in ama sia ngiaphual pua sangah pusuapui in suang taw deanglum uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Topa in Israel mite tungah a son tu in Moses thupia hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />“Na puante ii mong a king teng ah puanteap kaai vawt vun a, puanteap kaai sim ah vancii khauhual khat veu koi thua vun. Hite maisang hun theampo ah na vawt tu uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Puanteapkaaite in nung thu hong phawksak kik tu a, tuate na mu simin, ka thupiakte theampo phawk kikin na zui tu uh hi; tua sia ciang note deinate le uuknate zui nuam ngawlin, kei nong taisan buatu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Puanteapkaaite in kong thupiakte theampo na zui tu hong phawksak tu a, tuaciang note keima aa na hi siat tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Keima in Topa na Pathian ka hi hi; na Pathian hi tu in Egypt ngam pan kong pusua hi. Keima in Topa ka hi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Levi mi Kohath bee le phung pan Izhar tapa Korah in Moses ii lampuina langpanin leedo hi. Ama sia Reuben nam mihing thumte — Eliab tapate Dathan le Abiram, le Peleth tapa On — tuaciang mihonpite ii teal a minthang Israel lampui 250 te in pawlpui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amate teng Moses le Aaron mai ah kikhawm in, amate tungah, “Pai leet zo nu hi! taangpi theampo Topa aa hi a, eite theampo taw Topa omkhawm hi. Tua hikasap Moses awng banghangin Topa ii taangpite tungah om in thu kineisak tuan ni ziam?” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Moses hi thu a zaak ciang lei ah kilumliik in thungen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaciang ama in Korah le a nungzuite tungah, “Zing ciang zingsang in Topa in ama mihing sia akua ziam ei hong lak tu a; ama in a teal sa, a mi sia biaknatau ah ama kung neaksak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zing ciang zingsang in nangma le na nungzuite in meikam kuangte kengin tuate sungah meikam le ngimnamtui koi in, biaknatau ah paipui vun. Tuaciang Topa in eite akua hong teal ziam ci ih mu tu hi. A pai leet sia noma Levi te na hi uh hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Moses in Korah tungah a thuson zomin, “Levi mite awng, ngai vun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama kung na neak thei natu, Topa Puanbuk sungah na nasep thei natu uh le taangpite atu na a seam tu in Israel te ii Pathian in taangpi dang teng sung pan note hong tuam koina thu sia thuno in ngaisun nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama in nang le a dang Levi mi theampo hi bang hong upat zo a — tu in thiampi za zongh nga nuam in hanciam nu ziam!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aaron na phutsat uh ciang a tatakin ci leang nangma le na nungzuite in Pathian langpan na hi uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaciang Moses in Dathan le Abiram sam a, ahizong amate in, “Hong pai bua vak ung!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hilai duisung ah a thi tu in Egypt ngamnuam pan nong pusuapui sia pha zo hi ngawl ziam? Kote tungah to hong seam nuam lai ni ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ngamnuam leiphana ah nong paipui bua het a, kote neisa tu in lote le sapithuante zongh nong piak ngawl banah tu in theam tu hong hanciam lai ni hi. Hong pai bua vak ung!” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Moses thin uuk in Topa tungah, “Hi mihingte ii hong ken biakpiakna khat zongh saang heak in. Amate khat tungah zongh ka khial ngei bua a; a laate khat zongh ka laaksak ngei bua hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Moses in Korah tungah, “Zing ciang Topa ompuina Puanbuk ah nangma le na nungzui 250 te hong pai nanak tu nu hi; Aaron zongh tua munah om tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na meikamkuang tek kengin, a tungah ngimnamtui buakin, biaknatau ah pia tu nu hi ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuaciang a meikamkuang keng tek a, meikam le ngimnamtui a tungah koi in Puanbuk kongbiang ah Moses le Aaron taw ding uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Korah in taangpi bup kaikhawm in amate Puanbuk kongbiang ah Moses le Aaron maingat in ding uh hi. Thakhat thu in Topa ompuina khuavak taang velvol sia taangpi bup tungah kilangh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Topa in Moses le Aaron tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Hi mihingte kung pan nungkin vun, thakhat thu amate thatlum tu khi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahizong Moses le Aaron lei ah kunsuk a, “Aw, Pathian awng, nuntakna theampo ii naak na hi hi. Mihing khat a maw a khial ciang taangpi bup tungah thin uuk ni ziam?” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mipite sia Korah, Dathan le Abiram te ii buk pan a kikhiin natu in son in,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Moses sia Israel lampuite in zui in, Dathan le Abiram kungah pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Moses in mipite tungah, “Hi mi seksolte buk pan kiheam vun a, a neisa khat zongh tham heak vun. Tuabang na hi bua uh le a maw a khialnate hangin amate taw hong kimaimot khawm tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua ahiciang Korah, Dathan le Abiram te ii buk pan amate kiin uh hi. Dathan le Abiram hong pusuak in a buk kongbiang ah a zite le a tate taw dingkhawm uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Moses in mipite tungah, “Hi bang teng seam tu in Topa in kei hong sawl a, keima deiteal bangin a seam ka hi ngawlna thu na heak natu uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Pathian daan pawlkhat thuak ngawlin hi mite thi ngeina in, a thi le Topa hong sawl ka hi buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ahizong Topa in a kiza ngeingawl thu khat a sepna taw in amate le a neisa theampo sia lei in valh ahi hu in amate a hingtangin mithi khua a zot ciang amate in Topa nial a hina thu na he tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hi thu teng a son zawk po ciang Dathan le Abiram dinna leitang kihongin
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />amate le a innkuanpuite, Korah nungzui theampo le a neisate theampo taw valh siat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tuabangin, a neisa theampo taw a hingtangin mithi khua zuansuk uh hi. A tung pan lei in huk a, amate bomang siat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Amate auna aw a zaak ciang tualai a om Israel mipite theampo tai siat uh hi. Amate in, “Tai vun! Ei zongh lei in hong valhlum tha tu hi!” ci in au uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Topa in mei puak a, ngimnamtui a pia mi 250 te sia a meileng in haltum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tuaciang Topa in Moses tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />“Thiampi Aaron tapa Eleazer tungah taau meikamkuangte thiangtho ahikom mei ii kaklup mithi luangte kung pan taau meikamkuangte heam tu le tua kuangte pan meiholte mundang ah thethaang tu in son in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tuate Topa biaknatau ah a kipiak ciang a thiangtho suak hi. Tua ahiciang a mawna hangin thina a thuakte ii meikamkuangte la in biaknatau sit natu in pakan a paa in seak in. Hisia Israel mipite kidop natu thu hi tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tua ahiciang thiampi Eleazar in meikam kuangte la a, biaknatau sit natu in pakan a paa in seaksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Hi thu sia Aaron suan le paal simngawl kuama in biaknatau ah Topa atu in ngimnamtui hal in a pai ngawl natu, Israel te kidop natu ahi hi. Tua bangin a kidawm buale Korah le a mite bangin kithatlum tu hi. Moses tungtawnin Topa ii Eleazar tung, a thupiak bangin hite theampo kiseam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />A zing ciang taangpi bup in Moses le Aaron phunsan a, “ Topa ii mihing pawlkhat that zo nu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Moses le Aaron langpan tu in a kikhop zawk, amate teng Puanbuk sang a maingat ciang, meei in Puanbuk tuam a, Topa ii ompuina khuavak taang velvol sia mu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Moses le Aaron pai in Puanbuk mai ah ding uh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />“Hi mihingte kung pan kiheam vun, amate thakhat thu in thatlum siat tu khi hi!” ci hi. Amate nii lei ah kunsuk in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Moses in Aaron tungah, “Na meikam kuang la in a, biaknatau pan meikamte a sungah koi in, tua tungah ngimnamtui buak in. Tuaciang manlangin mihingte kungah paipui in, amate atu a zeksa thiansuana vawt in. Manlang in! Topa a thin uuk keak zo a, natna ngilo sia kipan zo hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Aaron in a thu ni a, a meikamkuang la in mihonpite kikhopna laizang ah tai hi. Tua natna kipan zo ci in a mu ciang, Aaron in meihol tungah ngimnamtui buakin mihonte atu in a zeksa thiansuana vawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tua in natna ngilo sia vengsak a, a thi le a hingte kilaklaw ah Aaron ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Korah ii leedona sungah a thite sim ngawlin a thi 14,700 pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Natna ngilo a ven zawkciang Moses omna Puanbuk kongbiang ah Aaron heak kik hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Israel mite tungah anam sim ii lampui sia tung pan ciangkhut khat tek, ciangkhut sawm le nii nang tungah hong piak natu in son in. A ciangkhut tungah a min tek at in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Levi nam ii a piak ciangkhut tungah Aaron min at in. A nam lampui khat ciang, ciangkhut khat tek hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka ompuina Puanbuk ah tuate paipui in a, kong kisik puina mun, Thuciamna Thingkuang mai ah koi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuasia ciang ka teal pa ii ciangkhut sia meang tu hi. Hi bangin Israel te ii nangma hong langpanin a phuphunna ka thimsak tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuabangin Moses in Israel te tungah son a, a nam sim pan ciangkhut khat tek, a lampuite in ama tungah pia a, a vekpi ciangkhut sawm le nii pha hi, tuate taw Aaron ciangkhut kikoi khawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Moses in ciangkhut teng Topa ii Thuciamna Thingkuang mai Puanbuk sungah koi siat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A zing ciang Puanbuk sungah Moses a tum ciang Levi nam ii a piak Aaron ciangkhut a meang sa in mu hi. Tuasia in mom zo, a paak palh zo a, almond nga minte piangsak hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Moses in ciangkhut theampo la in Israel te lak hi. Amate in thupiang teng mu a, a lampui sim in a ciangkhut tek la kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah, “Thuciamna Thingkuang mai ah Aaron ciangkhut koi kik in. Hi ciangkhut sia, a leedo nuam Israel te ii phunna a tawp buale amate thi tu a hisia a kidop natu in kepcing tu ahi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa thupiak bangin Moses in vawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Israel mite in Moses tungah, “Ko ka hi uh le man sa hi zo ung!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Puanbuk nai a neak te ngawngawn thi hamtang tu ahile, ko teng theampo zong a thi bang ka hi zo uh hi!” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in Aaron tungah, “Nangma, na tapate le Levi te in ka ompuina Puanbuk sung nasepna taw kisai in sepkhialna khat pawpo taw kizomin a piangte na thuak uh kul a; ahizong thiampi nasepna taw kisai in a piangte sia, nangma le na tapate bek in thuak tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nangma le na tapate Puanbuk sungah nasep laitakin, na seppui tu le nasep hong hu tu in Levi nam na beete tumpui in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amate in no atu in hong sepsak tu te le Puanbuk atu in a nasep tu te khuangkhim tu a, ahizong biaknatau taw ahibuale Mun Thiangtho ah a om a thiangtho vanhte peuma thutha ngawl tu hi. A thutha le amate le nangma hong kithisak khawm tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate sia nangma taw na seam tu a, Puanbuk sungah sep tu a vaipuakte theampo khuangkhim tu hi. Ahizong a kiphu ngawl peuma nang taw seam khawm thei ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Israel mite tungah ka thin uukna a puathap kik ngawl natu in nangma le na tapate bek in biaknatau le Mun Thiangtho vaipuak teng khuangkhim nanak tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Israel te sung pan na beete ahi Levi te teal a, letsong in hong pia pa sia keima ka hi hi. Amate in Puanbuk sungah a nasepte a sep thei natu in kei tungah hong ki aap uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahizong nangma le na tapate bek in biaknatau le Thiangthobel Mun ah a om sia taw kisai thiampi nasep teng theampo khuangkhim tu nu hi. Nang, thiampi za letsong in hong pia zo ka hikom hi teng nangma ii vaipuak tu ahi hi. Hi nasepte seam tu a kiphu ngawl khat pawpo hong pai in, vanh thiangthote a neak le kithisak tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa in Aaron tungah, “Kei hong kipia tuamte theampo sung pan biakpiakna sungah a kihaltumte simngawl po nangma kong piak sia ciamtee in. Hite nangma le na suan na paalte atu in a tawntung atu kong piak ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Biaknatau ah a kihal ngawl, a thiangthobel biakpiaknate panin a nuai a teng nangma aa ahi hi: antang biakpiakna, mawphel biakpiakna le khialphel biakpiakna te ahi hi. Kei tungah hong kipia a thiangtho biakpiakna te a vekpi in nangma le na tapate aa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hite mun thiangthona khat ah na neak uh kul hi, pa te bek in ne thei a; tua teng a thiangtho in ngaisun vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Tua bek dom ngawlin, Israel te ii a tuamin hong piak dangte pawpo zongh noma atu ahi hi. Nangma, na tapate le na tanute atu in maisang hun theampo atu in kong pia hi. Na inn sung pan biakna taw kisai a thiang mite theampo in tuate ne thei tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Israel te ii kum simin keima hong piak a anpal sung pan a phabel theampo: olive thau, sapittui le antangte nangma kong pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A vekpi in nangma aa ahi hi. Na innkuan sung pan biakna taw kisai in a thiang theampo in tuasia ne thei tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Israel ngam sungah kei tung hong ki aap thiang na theampo, nangma neisa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Israel te ii keima hong piak mihing taciil, ahibuale nganhing nosuakciil theampo nangma aa ahi hi. Ahizong mihing taciil hikale, biakna taw kisai a thiang ngawl nganhing nosuakciil hikale a kitat kik ciang a tatna sumte saang nanak tu ni hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Patangte tha khat a phak ciang, biakinn zakngei khaikhin taw kizui in ngunn dangkatang nga linlian taw kitan kik tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahizong khui, tuu le keal nosuakciil ahile kitan kik ngawl tu hi; a vekpi in keima aa hi a, sangaw biakpiak na tu ahi hi. A chi te biaknatau ah the in a; an taw biakpiakna in a thau halin, tua ngimnam in kei hong lungkimsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A tuam vilvel biakpiakna in a kizangh a awmsa le a ziatsang phei taw kibangin tuate ii a sa sia nangma aa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Israel te ii keima hong piaktuamte theampo maisang hun theampo atu in, nangma, na tapate le na tanute kong pia hi. Hi thu sia nangma le na suan na paalte taw ka vawt a kipaltan thei ngawl thuciamna ahi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Topa in Aaron tungah, “Nangma in a kilua thei na khat pawpo saang ngawl tu ni hi, Israel leitang khen khat zongh nang hong kipia ngawl tu hi. Keima, Topa sia nangma ii na kisap buppi ka hi hi.” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Topa in, “Israel mite ii kei tungah hong piak sawm a khat sumpi theampo Levi te ka pia zo hi. Hisia sia keima ompuina Puanbuk a kepcing hu in a nasep thaman ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Israel dangte in Puanbuk neak nawn ngawl het tu uh a, tuabangin a neak a om le thina daan thuak tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tu pan kipan Levi te bek in Puanbuk keamcing tu a, tua atu vaipuak theampo la siat tu uh hi. Hi thu na suan na paalte tung zongh ah a kizangh tu ngeina kip ahi hi. Levi te in Israel ngam sungah a kip a kho neisa bangma nei ngawl tu hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />banghang ziam cile Israel te ii kei tungah a tuam vilvel a hong piak sawm a khat sumpi sia amate ii neisa tu in ka pia zo hi. Tua hu in Israel ngam sungah a kip a kho in a neisa bangma nei ngawl tu hi, ci in amate ka son hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Topa in Levi te tungah a son tu in Moses thupia hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“ Topa in note neisa tu in hong piak sawm a khat sumpi sia Israel te tung pan na san uh ciang, sawm a khat a tuamin Topa tungah pia tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hi a tuam vilvel piakna sia lothote ii anthak le sapittui thak piakna taw kibangin kingaisun tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hi bangin Israel te tung pan na nga uh sawm a khat sumpite theampo sung pan zongh a tuamin Topa tungah pia tu nu hi. Hi bang a tuamin Topa atu piakna sia thiampi Aaron tungah pia tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tua sia a phabel na nga uh sung pan pia vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A phabel khen khat sia na piak zawk uh ciang a om lai teng, lothote ii biakpiakna a nei zawkciang a om lai teng a kepcing bangin keam thei nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Puanbuk sungah na nasep thaman uh ahikom, noma le na innkuan puite in a taanglai teng na ukna mun pawpo ah ne thei tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Topa tungah a phabel na piak zawk uh nungsang na neak uh ciang maw ngawl nu hi. Ahizong Israel te ii a piak letsong a thiangtho te a phabel khen khat sia Topa tungah a piak ma in na neakna uh taw tua letsong ninsak heak vun; na ninsak uh le hong kithatlum tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in Moses le Aaron tungah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />a nuai a ngeinate Israel te a piak tu in thupia hi. A mealhem ngawl le na a kiseamsak ngeingawl lai khuipui san khat paipui in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />thiampi Eleazar tungah pia hen. Tua khui ngiaphual pua sangah kipusua pui in, ama omna ah kingo tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuaciang Eleazar in a chi pawlkhat la in, Puanbuk sang ah a khutme taw salivei the tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua nganhing buppi, a vun a kipan, a sa, a chi le a ngilzang te thiampipa omna ah kihal tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaciang thiampipa in cedar thing tawm, hyssop dawn le khauzeen san khat la in mei sungah lawn tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua zawkciang ama in a puante sawp a, ama le ama tui a kibuak zawkciang ngiaphual ah tum thei tu hi; ahizong nitak dong biakna taw kisai in thiang ngawl lai tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Khui a halpa zongh a puante sawp in ama le ama tui kibuak hamtang tu a, ahizong ama zongh nitak dong thiang ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuaciang biakna taw kisai a thiang mihing khat in khuipui halna vaam teng luak tu a, ngiaphual puasang biakna taw kisai in a thiang na munah koi tu hi, tua te sia Israel taangpite a zeksa kithiansua na tui vawtna ah a hel tu in tualai ah kikeamcing tu hi. Hi a zeksa sia mawna silh natu in a kivawt ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua vaamte a luak pa in a puante sawp nanak tu a, ahizong ama nitak dong thiang ngawl lai tu hi. Hi ngeina sia Israel te le amate sung a teang ngamdangmite ii maisang hun theampo ah zui tu ngeina ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mithi luang a tham pawpo, ni sali sung biakna taw kisai in thiang ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama sia ni thum ni le ni sali ni in kithiansuana tui taw kithiansua nanak tu a, tuaciang ama a thiang hi tu hi. Ahizong ni thum ni le ni sali ni te ngeal sung ah, a kithiansua bua ahile ama thiang ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mithi luang tham a, ama le ama a kithiansua ngawl pawpo sia a nin ahi hi, banghang ziam cile kithiansuana tui ama tungah kibuak ngawl hi. Ama in Topa Puanbuk ninsak ahikom Topa ii mi khat in kingaisun nawn ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mihing khat buk sungah a thi le, a thi laitak buk sung a om pa ahizong, buk sung a tum pa ahizong, ni sali sung biakna taw kisai in a thiang ngawl ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Sitna nei ngawl buk sungah a om bungte le bealte zongh a nin suak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Doipua sangah mihing khat a kithatlum ahibuale thi ngei in a thi khat sia mihing khat pawpo in a tham le, ahibuale mihing khat pawpo in mithi ngu ahibuale mithi thaan a tham le, ama ni sali sung thiang ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hi bang mihingte a thian natu in, mawphel natu in a kihal khuipui san ii vaamte tawm la tu a, beal sungah koi in, tuithiang pol thua tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A masa in biakna taw kisai a thiang mihing khat in, hyssop dawn khat la tu a, tua hyssop dawn tui sungah papin, Puanbuk le a sung a om na theampo le mite the tu hi. A niina in, biakna taw kisai a thiang mihing khat in, mithi ngu, mithi luang ahibuale thaan a tham pawpo tungah tua tui the tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Biakna taw kisai a thiang mihing khat in ni thum ni le ni sali ni in mihing a thiang ngawl pa sia tua tui the tu hi. Ni sali ni in ama in tua pa thiansua tu hi, tua pa sia a puan sawp a, ama le ama tui a kibuak zawkciang, nitum ciangin biakna taw kisai a thiang suak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mihing khat pawpo biakna taw kisai thiang ngawlin, ama le ama a kithiansua buale thiang ngawl veve hi, banghang ziam cile kithiansuana tui ama kibuak ngawl lai hi. Ama in Topa ii Puanbuk ninsak a, Pathian ii mi khat in kingaisun nawn ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hi zui tu thu sia maisang hun theampo ah na zui tu ahi hi. Kithiansuana tui a the pa in zongh a puante sawp nanak tu hi; tua tui a tham peuma nitak dongin biakna taw kisai in thiang ngawl lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A thiang ngawl mi khat ii a tham na khat pawpo sia thiang ngawl a, tua na a tham peuma nitak dongin thiang ngawl lai hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tha masabel sungin Israel taangpi bup Zin duisung theng a, Kadesh ah ngiaphual saat uh hi. Tua munah Miriam thi in kiphum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua ngiaphual ah tui om ngawl ahikom Moses le Aaron kiim ah mite kikhawm in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“ Topa Puanbuk mai ah ih Israel mipuite taw thi khawm le ung phazaw tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Banghangin hi duisung ngampa ah hong paipui nu ziam? Hi lai ah ka ngannote taw a thi khawm thei tu in hong paipui nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Banghangin bangma a po ngawl na ngam a thinkiam huaina hi munah pai tu in, Egypt pan hong pusuapuinu ziam? Hi lai ah taang, thei, sapit, talee ngate om ngawl hi. Tui neak tu ngawngawn zongh om ngawl hi!” ci in mawsiat uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mipite kung pan Moses le Aaron pai vingveng in, Puanbuk kongbiang ah ding uh hi. Amate lei ah kunin, Topa ompuina khuavak taang velvol sia amate kungah kilangh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Thuciamna Thingkuang mai ah a om ciangkhut la in a, nangma le Aaron in taangpi bup kikhawmsak vun. Tualai amate theampo mai ah a om suangpi sia paupui in, tuaciang tua ii sung pan tui phuulkeak tu hi. Hi bangin mipite le a ngannote neak tu in suangpi pan tui na suaksak tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa thupiak bangin Moses pai in, tua ciangkhut la hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Moses le Aaron in tua suangpi mai ah taangpi bup kikhawmsak a, Moses in, “Ngai vun, ngual langpante awng! Note atu in hi suangpi pan tui kong suaksak tu uh ziam?” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuaciang Moses in a ciangkhut laamin suangpi niivei saat a, tuaciang tui tam mama hong luang vahe in, mite le ngannote theampo in dawn uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahizong Topa in Moses le Aaron teih zazaan hi. Ama in, “A thiangtho ka vaangletna Israel mite mai ah na telsak natu in upna a kicing nei ngawl na hi uh komin amate ka khapsa ngam ah note in amate lampui in na tumpui buatu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Israel mite ii Topa langpanin a phutsatna mun le ama thianthona a lakna mun ahi, Meribah ah hi thu teng piang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Moses in Kadesh pan Edom kumpipa tungah kamtaite paisak hi. Amate in, “Na mealheak uh ahi Israel minamte in hi bangin thu kong puak uh hi. Haksatna ka thuak uhte le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />ih taanghpupite bangbangin Egypt ah pai a, kote kum tam mama ka teenna uh thu na heak ahi hi. Egypt te in ih taanghpupite le kote hong vawtsia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Topa tungah hu ngenin ka kiko uh hi. Ama in kote ngetna aw za a, vantunglalang khat hong puak in Egypt pan hong pusua pui hi. Tu in, na ngamngi Kadesh khua ah ka om uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nong hesuakna in na ngam hong kaantansak ta'n. Kote le ka ngannote in lampial ngawlin, na lote le na sapithuante sungah pai ngawlin, na tuikhuk tuite kong neaksak buatu uh hi. Na ngamsung ka kaantan mateng, lamziikpi tung teng ka tawn tu uh hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ahizong Edom te in, “Koma ii ngam kong kaantansak buatu uh hi! Nong kaantan uh le kuanin kong sim tu uh hi,” ci in zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Israel mite in, “Lamziikpi tung ka tawn tu uh a, kote, ahibuale ka ngannote in na tui kong neaksak uh le a man kong pia tu uh hi — ko a paitan nuam ka hi bek uh hi,” ci in zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Edom te in, “Oai ngawl khu hi!” ci kik a, amate Israel te sim tu in a thahat ngalkaphonpi taw kuan uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Edom te in Israel te ii a ngam a kaantan tu oai ngawl ahikom Israel te heak kikin lamdang tawn uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Israel taangpi bup in Kadesh nusia a, Edom ngamngi Hor Mual theng uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tualai ah Topa in Moses le Aaron tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Israel te piak tu in ka ciamsa ngam ah Aaron tum ngawl tu hi; banghang ziam cile no nii in Meribah ah kong thupiak sia hong langpan na hi uh ciang Aaron thi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hor Mual ah, Aaron le a tapa Eleazar paipui to in a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />tualai ah Aaron ii a thiampi puante sutin Eleazar silhsak in. Aaron sia tualai ah thi tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Topa thupiak bangin Moses in seam hi. Taangpi bup muna ah amate Hor Mual ah paito uh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Moses in Aaron ii thiampi puante sutin Eleazar silhsak hi. Tua Mualdawn ah Aaron thi a, Moses le Eleazar ciasuk kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tangpi bup in Aaron thina thu he a, amate theampo ni sawmthum sung khuangai in om uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Canaan ngam thangsang ah a om Canaan mi Arad ngam ii kumpipa in Israel te Atharim lam tawnin hong pai a zaak ciang amate simin pawlkhat man hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Israel te in Topa tungah kiciamna khat vawt a: “Hi mihingte nong zosak le amate le a khuapite nangma tungah kong aap tu a, tuate ka lalcipsak tu hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amate ii pauna Topa in za a, Canaan te zosak hi. Tuaciang Israel te in Canaan te le a khuapite lalcipsak siat a, tua mun Hormah ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Israel te Hor Mual nusia in Edom ngam kiimveal in Aqaba Tuipi sangah pai uh hi. Ahizong lampi ah amate a thin vei zo ngawlin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian le Moses langpanin sonsia uh hi. Amate in, “An le tui om ngawlna hi mun sennealngam sungah a thi tu in banghang Egypt ngam pan hong pusuapui ni ziam? An lim ngawl hi bang te po ka ne zo buatu uh hi!” ci in phunsan uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Topa in amate sungah ngul ngu neite tha a, Israel te tam mama ngul tukin thi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mite Moses kungah pai in, “ Topa le nang langpanin kong sonsiat uh sia maw khu hi. Tu in hi ngulte a laak natu in Topa tungah thu ngen in,” ci uh hi. Tua ahiciang a mite atu in Moses in thungen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Topa in Moses tungah, taau ngul khat vawt in a, ngul tuk thuak mihing khat pawpo in tuasia a et ciang damna a nga thei natu in, khuam tungah khai in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuaciang Moses in taau ngul khat vawtin khuam tungah khai hi. Ngul tuk thuak pawpo in tua taau ngul en a damna nga hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Israel te kikhiin in Oboth ah ngiaphual saat uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua mun a nusiat zawkciang, Moab ngam nisuana sang a lalsa Abiram ngam duisung ah ngiaphual saat uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Zered Kuam ah ngiaphual saat uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua mun pan kikhiin kik leleau a, Arnon Ngun ii saksang Amor ngam dong a zai duisung ah ngiaphual saat uh hi. (Arnon sia Moab le Amor mite ngamngi ahi hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ahi hu in Topa ii Ngal donate Laibu sungah , “… Suphah huamsung Waheb khua, le a kuamte; Arnon Ngun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />tuaciang Ar khua dong a ban ngamkuam dungsuk teng le Moab ngamngi sang dong in,” ci in son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua mun pan Tuikhuk kicina munah amate paitanin, tualai ah Topa in Moses tungah, “Mipite kikhawmsak in, amate tui pia tu khi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua laitakin Israel mite in hi la sak uh hi: “Tuikhuk te awng, na tui phuulsak vun; Lasakna taw muak tu khu hi —
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kumpi tate ii kumpi ciangkhut taw, Mipi lampuite ii a ciangkhut taw in a kito Tuikhuk na hi hi,” ci hi. Amate duisung panin Mattanah ah kikhiin uh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />tua mun pan Nahaliel zuanin, Nahaliel pan Bamoth ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Bamoth panin sennealngam a kimu theina Pisgah Mualdawn nuai Moab ngamkuam theng uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Israel mite in Amor te kumpi Sihon kungah kamtaite paisak a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Na ngam hong kaantansak tavun. Kote le ngannote in lampial in na lote, ahibuale na sapithuante sungah pai ngawl tu khu hi. Na tuikhukte pan tui ka ne buatu uh hi; na ngam ka kaantan mateng, lamziikpi tung teng ka tawn tu uh hi,” cisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ahizong Sihon in Israel mite ii a ngam a kaantan tu oai ngawl hi. Ama in a ngalkaphonpi khawm a, duisung Jahaz ah pai in Israel te sim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ahizong ngal kidona ah Israel te in a ngalte tam mama that a, Arnon ngun pan Jabbok saksang dong laaksak hi, banghang ziam cile tua mun sia Ammon ngam hi a, Ammon te in a ngamngi nasia takin hung uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuaciang Israel mite in Amor khuapi theampo la siat a, Heshbon le a kiim a om khuate zongh la in tua khua teng theampo sungah teang uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Heshbon sia Amor te kumpipa Sihon teenna khuapi hi a, Sihon sia Moab kumpi masa a do pa le Arnon Ngun dong a ngam theampo a laaksak pa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua hu in laphuakte in, “Kumpipa Sihon ii khuapi Heshbon ah hong pai tavun! Tua khuapi a kisa kik le a kipua kik mu nuam khu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Khatvei lai, Heshbon khuapi panin Sihon ngalkaphonpi sia meikuang khat taw kibangin pai a; Moab ngamsung Ar khuapi lalcipsakin Arnon thunghsang mualte kaanghtum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Moab mite awng, no atu bang zata lauhuai ziam! No Chemosh a bia te lal siat nu hi! Na pathian in pate ngaltaite suaksak a, Numeite Amor kumpipa ii ngalmatte suaksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ahizong tu in a suan a paalte Heshbon pan Dibon lam tawntung Nashim pan Medeba khua nai Nophah dong kimon hi,” ci in phua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuabangin Israel mite Amor te ngam sungah teang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Moses in Jazer khuapi sim natu lampi phabel a zong tu in mihingte paisak hi. Israel te in tua khuapite le a kiim ah khuate la in tua mun ah a teang Amor te not keak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Israel te Bashan lam tawnin heakkik a, Bashan Kumpi Og sia amate sim tu in a ngalkaphonpi taw Edrei ah kuan uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah, “Ama kiita heak in. Hi kumpipa, a mihing theampo le a ngam a lei kong zosak tu hi. Heshbon khua a uk Amor Kumpipa Sihon tungah na vawt bangin ama tungah vawt in,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tua ahikom Israel te in Og, a tapate le a mite theampo khat zongh khoaikhe ngawlin thatlum siat a, tua zawkciang amate in a ngam lua uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel te kikhiin kikin, Jericho ngalkhat Jordan nisuana sang Moab zaangtam ah ngiaphual saat uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel te in Amor te tungah a vawtna teng le Israel te bangza tam ci sia Zippor tapa Balak, Moab kumpipa in a zaak ciang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />ama le a mihingte theampo patau mama uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Moab te in Midian lampuite tungah, “Khuital in a tatna ah lopa a neak bangin hi mihonpi in, ih kiim ih paam teng hai ngawlin lalcipsak siat tu hi,” ci uh hi. Tua ahiciang Balak Kumpipa in
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amaw ngam Euphrates Ngun hui Pethor ah a om Beor tapa Balaam sam tu in kamtaite paisak hi. Amate in Balak ii kam vaithak hi teng Balaam puak hi: “Kong heaksak nop thu panin, Egypt pan minam bup khat hong pai a; a mite sia mun theampo ah kithethaang in, ih ngam hong laksak tu kithoai zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amate eite sangin tamzaw ahikom nong hesuakna in hong pai ta'n a, kei atu hong haamsiatsak ta'n. Tuasia ciang kote in amate zo in, ngamsung pan notkeak thei tha tu khu hi. Nangma ii thupha na piak ciang mihingte in thupha nga a, na haamsiat ciang amate haamsiatna khat thuak hi, ci in ka he hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua hi a, Moab te le Midian te ii lampuite in a haamsiat natu a thap man tu kengin Balaam kungah pai in, Balak kam vaithak teng son uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Balaam in amate tungah, “Tu zan hi lai ah taam vun a, Topa hong son pawpo, zing ciang kong son kik tu hi,” ci hi. Tua ahikom Moab lampuite Balaam kungah taam uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Balaam kungah Pathian pai in, “Nang kungah hong ngiakte a kuate ziam?” ci in dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Balaam in, “Moab Kumpipa Balak ii kamtaite hi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Egypt pan hong pai mite ngamsung bup ah a kizelna thu hong sonsak hi. Ama in amate do in a nawkeak thei natu in haamsiatsak le hong oai hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pathian in Balaam tungah, “Hi mite zui heak in a, Israel mite haamsiat heak in, banghang ziam cile amate sia ka thupha piakte ahi uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A zingsang ciang Balaam sia Balak ii kamtaite kungah pai in, “Cia kik tavun; Topa in note kong zui tu oai ngawl hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ahiciang amate Balak kungah cia kik a, Balaam ii zui nop ngawlna thu teng son uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Balak in a masa lai sang a, a tamzaw le a thupi zaw lampuite thataak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amate Balaam kungah pai in, “Nong hesuakna in ka kungah nong pai tu bangma peuma in khaksak heak in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Thaman tam mama kong pia tu a, nong son babang ka vawt tu hi. Nong hesuakna in hong pai ta'n a, kei atu hi mite hong haamsiatsak ta'n,” ci in Balak ii kam vaithak teng son uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ahizong Balaam in, “Balak in a kumpi inn sung a om ngunn le khamh theampo hong pia zong, Topa ka Pathian ii thupiak a nobel zongh ka nial thei bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ahizong nong hesuakna in ngualdangte bangma, tu zan taam vun, tua hile Topa in thudang son tu hong nei ziam hong nei bua ziam ka he tu hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua zanin Balaam kungah Pathian pai a, “Nangma sam tu in hi mite hong pai ahile, kithoai in zui ta'n, ahizong kong son teng bek vawt in,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua hi a, a zingsang ciang Balaam in a laa tung to in Moab lampuite zui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuabang Balaam in zui ahikom Pathian thin uuk hi. Balaam sia a naseam niite tonpui a, a laa tung to in a pai laitak a lampi khak tu in Topa vantunglalang khat lamlai ah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua laa in namsau khat a toai vantunglalang tua munah ding a mu ciang lampial in lo sung zuan hi. Balaam in a laa saatin lampi ah hawl kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuaciang lamciakna sapithuan nii kilaklaw, a lang le a lang suangpang omna munah vantunglalang sia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A laa in vantunglalang a mu ciang leangin suangpang phul a, Balaam ii peang suangpang taw kingoai hi. Balaam in a laa saat kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Khatvei ma vantunglalang a mai ah kiin leleau a; paitan natu a om ngawl het lampi ciakna mun khat ah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tu ciang, laa sia vantunglalang a mu ciang boksuk hi. Balaam a thin vei zo ngawlin, a ciang taw a laa saat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Topa in laa sia kampau theina vaang pia a, laa in Balaam tungah, “Nang bang hong law na khi ziam? Banghangin thumvei hong saat ni ziam?” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Balaam in, “Banghang ziam cile kei nong mawmawt vawt hang hi! Namsau nei leng hong thatlum tu khi hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Laa in, “Na khan tawntung, nong tona laa sia ma hi ngawl kana khi ziam? Nidangin hi bangin hong vawt ngei na khi ziam?” ci in zo kik hi. Balaam in, “Nong vawt ngei bua hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuaciang, Topa in Balaam, tua munah namsau taw a ding vantunglalang sia musak a; Balaam lei ah boksuk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Vantunglalang in, “Banghang hi bang na laa thumvei saat ni ziam? Hi bang a pai tu hi ngawl na hikom, na mai khak tu in kong pai zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ahizong na laa in kei hong mu a, thumvei hong pial hi. Tuabang hong pial buale nangma hong thatin, na laa a khoaikhe tu ka hi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Balaam in, “Maw zo khi hi. Kei hong pangin lampi ah na din hunlam ka he bua hi; ahizong tu in ka paisuak tu khial nong sa ahile ka heak kik tu hi,” ci in zo kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ahizong vantunglalang in, “Hi mite taw paisuak in a, ahizong son a kong sawl teng bek son in,” ci hi. Tuabangin Balaam in amate zui suak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Balak in Balaam a pai hunlam a zaak ciang Moab ngamngi Arnon Ngun tung a om Ar khuapi ah muak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Balak in Balaam tungah, “Kong samsak maksak lai in banghangin hong pai ngawl ni ziam? A kicing thaman pia zo ngawl tu in hong um ni ziam?” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Balaam in, “Hong pai zo hi ngawl khi ziam? Ahizong tu in a bang vaang nei na khi ziam? Pathian ii son a hong sawl teng bekma son thei khi hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tuaciang Balaam sia Balak taw Huzoth khua ah pai in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />tualai ah Balak in khui le tuu ngoin, a sa pawlkhat Balaam le a tonpui lampuite pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />A zingsang ciang Balak in Balaam sia Bamoth Baal ah paipui to hi, tua mun panin Balaam in Israel mite khen khat mu thei hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Balaam in Balak tungah, “Hi lai ah biaknatau sali kei atu in hong vawtsak ta'n a, khuital sali le tuutal sali hong paipui ta'n,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A ci bangin Balak in seam a, ama le Balaam in biaknatau sim ah khuital khat le tuutal khat veu pia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Balaam in Balak tungah, “ Topa in kei hong mu nuam ziam hong mu nuam ngawl ziam, pai in ka na et laanin, nang na meihal biakpiakna hui ah na ding zii in. Ama ii kei tungah hong pualaakna babangin kong son kik tu hi,” ci hi. Tuaciang Balaam sia mualdawn ah ama nguak kaato a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pathian taw kimu hi. Balaam in Topa tungah, “Biaknatau sali ka vawt a tuate tungah khuital khat le tuutal khat veu biakpiakna in ka pia zo hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa in Balaam tungah, Balak atu a kam vaithak teng a son tu in heak kik sak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ahiciang ama heak kik a Balak, a meihal biakpiakna hui ah Moab lampui theampo taw ding khawm lai sia mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Balaam in hi kamsaanna pualaak hi: “Moab kumpipa Balak in Syria pan, nisuana mualte panin hong paipui hi. Balak in, ‘Hong pai ta'n a, kei atu in Israel mite haamsiat in’ hong ci hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pathian ii haamsiat ngawl sia bangbang haamsiat thei tu a, Topa ii a ci ngawl po bangbang kei lalsak na thu son tu khi ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Suangpi saang tung pan amate ka mu thei a; Mualtung pan amate ka en thei hi. Amate minam khat in nungta bek a; Minam dangte sangin thupha a nga zawkna thu amate in he uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Israel suan le paalte leivui bangma hi a — a phakza sim tu tamleih lawlawm hi. Pathian mite khat bangin ka ni ka hunte hong bosak ta'n a; Mihing thutakte bangin nuam takin hong thisak ta'n.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Balak in Balaam tungah, “Kei tungah bang hong vawt ni ziam? Hi lai ah ka ngalte haamsiat tu in kong paipui a, ahizong amate thupha na pia pumsai hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama in, “ Topa ii son tu a hong sawl teng bek son thei khi hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuasia zawkciang Balak in Balaam tungah, “Israel te pawlkhat bek na mu thei natu mundang khat ah hong zui ta'n. Tua mun pan amate hong haamsiatsak ta'n,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama in Balaam sia Zophim lo sung Pisgah Mualdawn ah paipui hi. Tua mun zongh ah ama in biaknatau sali vawtin tua tungah khuital khat le tuutal khat veu biakpiakna in pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Balaam in Balak tungah, “Na meihal biakpiakna hui hi sungah na ding in a, tua munah Pathian taw ka na kimu tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Topa sia Balaam taw kimu a, a kam vaithak teng a son zawkciang Balak tungah a son tu in ciasak kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ahiciang ama heak kik a, Balak meihal biakpiakna hui ah Moab lampuite taw dingkhawm lai sia mu hi. Topa in bang hong ci ziam ci in Balak in dongh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Balaam in hi kamsaanna pualaak hi: “Zippor ii tapa Balak awng hong pai ta'n, Kong son tu thute hong ngai ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pathian sia a leilot thei mihingte taw kibang ngawl a; Ama sia a thin a kheal papai mihing hi ngawl hi. A kamciamna babang seam a; A pau bangin taangtung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Thupha pia tu in hong kisawl a, Pathian in thupha a piak ciang ka khealsak kik thei bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Israel te mai sangah bangma kaamsiatna ahibuale ngimna a thuak tu ka mu kholsak bua hi. Topa a Pathian in amate ompui a; Ama sia a kumpipa hi ci in thangsak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pathian in Egypt pan amate pusuapui a; Ama in ngam khuital khat bangin amate panpui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Israel minam langpan natu a kizangh thei bum ahizong, ai ahizong om ngawl hi. Tu in mihingte in Israel te thu son tu a, ‘En vun Pathian nasepna paw!’ ci tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Israel minam sia a thahat tawpi khat taw kibang a: A sa matte ii sa, balneen in a valh mateng, A chi a dawn mateng in, tawlnga ngawl hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Balak in Balaam tungah, “Israel mite haamsiat tu nong nial a, tua ahile amate thupha pia heak ka lam in!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Balaam in, “ Topa hong sawl theampo a seam tu ka hisia hong son zo hi ngawl khi ziam?” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Balak in, “Hong pai ta'n, mundang khat ah kong paipui tu hi. Tua mun pan kei atu in, amate na haamsiat tu Pathian in hong oai zongh hi thei tha tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua ahiciang Balak in sennealngam a ki ensuk theina Peor Mualdawn ah Balaam paipui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Balaam in Balak tungah, “Hi lai ah biaknatau sali kei atu in sa in a, khuital sali le tuutal sali kei atu hong paipui ta'n,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ama ci bangin Balak in seam a, khuital khat le tuutal khat veu biaknatau khat sim tungah biakpiakna in pia hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel mite thupha pia tu in Topa ii ama a dei hunlam tu in Balaam in he ahikom, nidang a vawt ngei bangin aisaan tu in pai nawn ngawl hi. Ama sennealngam sang ngaa a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel mite anam anam in ngiaphual a saat sia mu hi. Pathian thaa in ama uk a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />ama in hi kamsaanna pualaak hi: “Beor tapa Balaam ii thupuak, Thiang takin a mu theipa ii kammalte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pathian son bang a za theipa ahi hi. Mit hak kiukiau in mangmuna khat ka mu a, Vaanglianbelpa Pathian tung pan mukholna hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Israel Puanbukte et hoi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A ngual sau in a kiciing palm kungte, ahibuale ngunhui ah huante taw kibang a, Topa ii a ciin aloe kungte ahibuale tui hui a po cedar kungte taw kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate in nguatui cing takin nga tu uh a, nguatui zen lote ah a thaiciite ciing tu hi. A kumpipa sia Agag kumpipa sangin lian zaw tu a, Ama ukna ngam sia zaikeak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pathian in amate Egypt ngam pan pusua pui a; Ama in ngam khuital khat bangin amate ngaldo pui hi. Amate in a ngalte lopvalh a, A ngute khimtham in a thaltangte thiaktan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua minam sia a thahat tawpi khat taw kibang a; A mut laitakin kuama in phong ngam ngawl hi. Israel thupha a pia pawpo thupha kipia tu a, Israel a haamsiat pawpo kihaamsiat tu hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Balak thin uukin a khut tumin Balaam tungah, “Ka ngalte haamsiat tu in kong sam a, ahizong tu in amate na haamsiat sangin thumvei tak thupha na piazaw pum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tu in, inn ah cia in! Thaman piak tu in kong kamciam a, ahizong na thaman nga tu sia Topa in hong khak hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Balaam in, “Ka kungah kamtai nong paisakte tungah ka sonsa bangin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />na kumpi inn sungah a om ngunn le khamh theampo nong pia zong, Topa thupiakna nialin keima thu taw bangma ka seam buatu hi. Topa in son a hong sawl teng bek ka son tu hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Balaam in Balak tungah, “Tu in ka mipuite kungah ka cia kik tu a, ahizong ka cia ma in, mailam sangah Israel mite ii na mite tungah a vawt tu teng na kidop natu in kong sonkhol tu hi.” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuaciang ama in hi kamsaanna pualaak hi: “Beor tapa Balaam ii thupuak; Thiang takin a mu thei pa ii kammalte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pathian son bang a za thei pa in A Saang Belna pan hong pai thuheakna nga hi. Vaanglianbelpa Pathian tung pan mangmuna khat mit hak kiukiau in ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Maisang hun tu ka en a, Israel minam ka mu hi. Tua minam sungah, Aksi taang taw kibang kumpi khat piang tu hi. Thazau bangin Israel sungah ama hong khang tu hi. Ama in Moab lampuite saat tu a, Seth mite theampo saatvawk tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama in Edom ngam ah a ngalte zo tu a, A ngalte ngam le lei ama ii neisa sua tu a, Israel sia a ngualzo hi tawntung tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Israel minam in amate tuanhcil tu a, A suakta khakbel teng mon tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Balaam ii mukholna sungah Amalek te mu a, hi bangin kamsaanna pualaak hi: “Amalek sia minam theampo sung pan a thahatbel hi a, ahizong a khakbel ciang a tawntung maaimang tu hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama mukholna sungah Balaam in Ken te mu a, hi kamsaanna pualaak hi: “Na teenna mun muanhuai a, Suangliang saang tungah a om vacimbu bangin bit hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahihang Assyria in note salin hong mat ciang, no, Ken te hong kilalcipsak tu hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Balaam in hi bang kamsaanna pualaak hi: “Sak sangah a kikhawm hi mihingte a kuate ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Cyprus pan ngalsim tute teambaw taw hong pai tu a; Amate in Assyria le Eber zo tu hi, Ahizong amate zongh a tawntungin lalcip tu uh hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Balaam kithoai in inn ah ciakik a, Balak sia a pai natu ah paisuak hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel te Acacia Kuam ah ngiaphual a saat lai in, pate in tua munah a om Moab numeite khialpui uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua numeite in Moab pathian a kibiakna mun sangaw biakpiakna poai ah amate sam uh hi. Israel te in an ne in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Peor ii Baal pathian bia uh hi. Tua ahikom amate tungah Topa thin uuk a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Moses tungah, “Israel lampui theampo sam in a, ka thu nong nitna in suntangin amate thatlum siat in, tua hile a mite tungah ka thin uuk nawn ngawl tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Moses in uliante tungah, “Note khat simin na nam sungah Peor ii Baal pathian a bia teng peuma thatlum tu nu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Moses le Israel taangpi bup khuangai in Topa ompuina Puanbuk kongbiang ah kapin a om laitak, amate mu tangin Israel te khat in Midian numei khat ama puanbuk sungah tumpui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua thu Eleazar tapa, thiampi Aaron tupa, Phinehas in a mu ciang a kikhopna pan dingin pusuak hi. Ama in tei khat la a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />tua pa le tua nu ii nung pan zui in Puanbuk sungah a nii in khawlet hi. Hi bangin Israel te tungah a tung natsiatna sia kivengsak a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />ahizong mihing 24,000thisak zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Phinehas ngamtatna hangin Israel mite tungah ka thin a uk nawn bua hi. Ama in keima simngawl Pathian dang biak tu peuma a dei ngawlpa hi a tua thu hangin thin uuk hi kaleng amate ka mon bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ahiciang maisang hun theampo ah a kip tu thuciamna khat Phinehas taw ka vawt tu sia ama tungah son in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kei hong demte peuma saang ngawl a, Israel te ii mawmai sakna zongh piangsak ahikom ama le a suan a paalte thiampi kiseamsak top hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Midian numei taw thalup a thuak khawm Israel sia pa ii min Zimri hi a, Simeon nam sung pan innkuan lutang sia Salu tapa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua numei min sia Cozbi ahi hi. A pa sia Zur hi a, Midian bee le phung honkhat ii ukpi ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Midian te sim in a, mon in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />banghang ziam cile Peor ah note hong theamin a tatsiat uh hang le Peor ah natsiatna a tun lai in a kithatlum Cozbi hang ahi hi,” ci in thupia hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Natsiatna a ven ciang Topa in Moses le Aaron tapa Eleazar tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Israel taangpi bup, kum kul le a tungsia, ngalkap a seam thei tu pa theampo a innkuan zui in mihing simna vawt in,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Moses le Eleazar in a thu ni a, kum kul pan a tungsia a pha, pa theampo kaikhawm hi. Amate sia Jericho pan Jordan Ngunngal khat Moab zaangtam ah kikhawm uh hi. Hite sia Egypt pan a pusuak Israel mite ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Reuben nam (Reuben sia Jacob tapa lianbel hi) pan: Hanoch, Pallu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hezron le Carmi bee le phungte ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hi nam teng sungah pasal 43,730 om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pallu suan le paalte sia Eliab,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />le a tapate Nemuel, Dathan le Abiram te ahi hi, (Dathan le Abiram sia taangpi ii teal ahi hi. Amate in Moses le Aaron thu nialin Topa a leedo Korah nungzuite taw kikop hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lei kihongin amate valhlum a, amate le Korah thi uh hi, tuaciang a nungzui pasal 250 teng mei in kaanghlum a, amate sia mihingte kidopna tu suak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahizong Korah tapate kithatlum ngawl hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Simeon nam pan; Nemuel, Jamin, Jachin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Zerah le Shaul bee le phungte ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hi bee le phungte sungah pasal 22,200 om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Gad minam pan : Zephon, Haggi, Shuni,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ozni, Eri,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Arod le Areli bee le phungte ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hi bee le phungte sungah pasal 40,500 om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Judah nam pan: Shelah, Perez, Zerah, Hezron le Hamul bee le phungte ahi hi. (Judah ii tapa nii ahi Er le Onan sia, Canaan ngam ah thi hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hi bee le phungte sungah pasal 76,500 om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Issachar nam pan: Tola, Puah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Jashub le Shimron bee le phungte ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hi bee le phungte sungah pasal 64,300 om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Zebulun nam pan: Sered, Elon, le Jahleel bee le phungte ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hi bee le phungte sungah pasal 60,500 om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tapa nii ii pa Joseph namte sia Manasseh le Ephraim ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Manasseh nam pan: Manasseh tapa Machir sia Gilead ii pa hi a, a nuai a bee le phung teng sia Gilead ii suante:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Iezer, Helek,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Asriel, Shechem,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Shemida le Hepher bee le phungte ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hepher tapa Zelophehad in tapa nei ngawl a, tanu bek nei hi. A tanute min sia Mahlah, Noah, Hoglah, Milcah le Tirzah ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Hi bee le phungte sungah pasal 52,700 om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ephraim nam pan: Shuthelah, Becher, le Tahan bee le phungte ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Eran bee le phung sia Shuthelah ii suan le paalte ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Hi bee le phungte sungah pasal 32,500 om hi. Hi bee le phungte sia Joseph ii suan le paalte ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Benjamin nam pan: Bela, Ashbel, Ahiram,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Shephupham le Hupham bee le phungte ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Ard le Naaman bee le phungte sia Bela ii suan le paalte ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Hi bee le phungte sungah pasal 45,600 om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Dan nam pan: Hushim bee le phung hi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />pasal 64,400 om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Asher nam pan: Imnah, Ishvi, le Beriah bee le phungte ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Heber le Malchiel bee le phungte sia Beriah ii suan le paalte ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Asher in ta numei khat nei a, a min Serah ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Hi bee le phungte sungah pasal 53,400 om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Naphtali nam pan: Jahzeel, Guni,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Jezer, le Shillem bee le phungte ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Hi bee le phungte sungah pasal 45,400 om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Israel pasal a vekpi in 601,730 pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />“A mi phaza zui in, hi namte ngam hawmsak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Lai meetang sawkin ngam hawmsak in a, mi tam namte ngamzai pia in, mi tawm namte ngamno pia in,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Levi nam sungah Gershon, Kohath le Merari bee le phungte kihel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />A suan le paalte sungah Libni, Hebron, Mahli, Mushi, le Korah bawngte kihel hi. Kohath sia Amram ii pa hi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Amram in Egypt pan a piang Levi ii tanu Jochebed teenpui hi. Ama in Amram taw tapa nii, Aaron le Moses le tanu khat Miriam nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Aaron in tapa li nei a, Nadab, Abihu, Eleazar le Ithamar ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Nadab le Abihu te sia Topa tungah a thiangtho ngawl meihal biakpiakna a piak ciang thi khawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Levi mite tha khat pan a tungsia pa 23,000 pha hi. Amate Israel ngam sungah neisa bangma kipia ngawl ahikom Israel midangte taw kihel ngawlin a tuamin kiciamtee hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Hi bee le phungte theampo Moses le Eleazar in Jericho pan, Jordan Ngunngal khat Moab zaangtam ah Israel mite mihing simna a vawt lai a kiciamtee ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />Moses le Aaron ii Sinai Sennealngam ah mihing sim phit lai in a kihelte khat zongh taang nawn ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />Topa in amate a vekpi in dui sungah thi siat tu hi, a ci bangin Jephunneh tapa Caleb le Nun tapa Joshua simngawl thi siat hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Joseph tapa Manasseh, Manasseh tapa Machir, Machir tapa Gilead, Gilead tapa Hepher, Hepher tapa, Zelophehad ii tanute sia Mahlah, Noah, Hoglah, Milcah le Tirzah te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amate pai in Moses, thiampi Eleazar, lampuite le taangpi bup ii mai, Topa ompuina Puanbuk kongbiang ah ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Ka pa uh in tapa nei ngawlin duisung ah hong thi san hi. Ama sia Topa a langpan Korah ii nungzuite sungah kihel ngawl a; ama mawna hangin thi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tapa a nei ngawl hu bekin ka pa ii min banghangin Israel sung pan bo tu ziam? Kote ii pa ii mealheakte taw in ko zongh ngamh hong pia tavun,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Moses in amate thu Topa tungah ko a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />tuaciang Topa in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Zelophehad tanute ii ngetna maan hi; a pa mealheakte taw in ngamh piakhawm in. A pa ngamh amate in lua tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pasal khat in tapa nei ngawlin a thi ciang a tanu in a neisa lua tu hi, ci in Israel mite son in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama in tanu a nei buale ama ii suapui pate in lua tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama in suapui pa a nei buale, a pa ii suapui pate in lua tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama in suapui pa ahibuale papi, pano a nei buale a bee kuungbel khat in lua tu a, ama ii neisa suak hi. Hi thu sia Keima Topa ii kong thupiak hi a, Israel mite zui tu thukham ahi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah, “Abarim Mualte tungah kaato in a, Israel te ka piak tu ngam le lei sia ngal et in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuasia na mu zawkciang na suapuipa Aaron thi bangin na thi tu hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />banghang ziam cile Zin duisung ah kong thupiak sia noma ngeal in nong langpan uh hang hi. Meribah ah Israel taangpi bup in keima hong phutsat lai in, a thiangtho ka vaangletna amate mai ah ahi tubangin nong saang nuam bua uh hi,” ci hi. (Meribah sia Zin duisung Kadesh khua ah a om ciktui naak ahi hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Moses thungen a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Nuntakna theampo ii naak ahi Topa Pathian awng,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />na mipite tuucing nei ngawl tuute bang ahi ngawl natu in a lampui thei tu le ngal kisimna ah thu a pia thei tu mihing khat nong tealsak natu in, thu kong ngen hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah, “Kicinna a nei Nun tapa Joshua sam in, a lu tungah na khut nga in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Thiampi Eleazar le taangpi bup mai ah ama dingsak in a, amate theampo ii mai ah nangma hong laih a hina thu thangsak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Israel taangpi bup in a thu a nit thei natu in, na thuneina pawlkhat ama pia in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Joshua in thiampi Eleazar suang tu a, Eleazar in keima deina a heak natu in Urim le Thummim zangh tu hi. Tuabangin Joshua le Israel taangpi bup sia thu theampo ah Eleazar in vaihawm tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Topa thupiakna bangin Moses in seam hi. Ama in Thiampi Eleazar le taangpi bup mai ah Joshua dingsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Topa thupiak bangin Moses in Joshua lu tungah a khut nga in, ama a laih a hina thu thangsak hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel te in a kisee hunin ama a lungkimsak ahi, a kitaangsamh an biakpiaknate Pathian tungah a piak natu a sawl natu in thupia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hite sia Topa tungah a kipia tu an piakkhiatnate ahi hi: ni sim meihal biakpiak natu in a mealhem ngawl kum khat a pha tuutalno nii hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuuno a khatna sia zingsang in kipia tu a, a niina sia nitakin kipia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua tuuno khat sim taw antang piakkhiatna khat ahi a phabel olive thau litre khat a kihel anvui kilogramme khat kipia khawm tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hisia in Sinai Mual tungah a masabel an biakpiakna in a kipia sa, a kihaltum ni sim biakpiakna hi a, tua in Topa a lungkimsak ngimnam ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A masa tuuno sia taw sapittui biakpiakna na piak uh bangin biaknatau ah sapittui litre khat buak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sapittui taw zingsang biakpiakna a kipiak khop bangma in, nitakin a niina tuuno sia pia vun. Tuasia zongh a ngimnam taw Topa a lungkimsak an taw biakpiakna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Sabbath ni in a mealhem ngawl, kum khat a pha tuutal no nii, antang biakpiakna in olive thau taw a kihel anvui kilogramme 2 le sapittui biakpiakna pia vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hi meihal biakpiakna sia ni simin sapittui biakpiakna belapna in Sabbath ni simin piak tu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tha sim a ni khat ni in, Topa tungah meihal biakpiakna a nuai a bangin pia vun: khuitalno nii, tuutal khat, kum khat a pha tuutalno sali, a vekpi in a mealhem ngawl hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Antang biakpiakna in olive thau taw a kihel anvui pia vun: khuital khat ciang anvui kilogramme 3 veu; tuutal sia anvui kilogramme 2
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />le, tuuno khat ciang anvui kilogramme khat veu taw pia vun. Hi meihal biakpiaknate sia an biakpiakna hi a, Topa a lungkimsak ngimnam khat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Piak ngengei sapittui biakpiakna sia khuital khat ciang sapittui litre 2, tuutal sia sapittui litre khat le lang le tuuno khat ciang sapittui litre khat veu taw piak tu ahi hi. Hisia kum khat tawntung tha sim, a ni khat ni in meihal biakpiakna ah zui tu ngeina ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuaciang sapittui biakpiakna taw ni sim meihal biakpiakna belapna in, mawphel biakpiakna in kealtal khat pia vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Topa patoaina Paisan Poai sia tha masabel, ni sawm le ni li ni in, kivawt tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A ni sawm le ni nga ni in, biakna poai kipan a, ni sali sung poai kikhaam tu hi, tua hunsung teng tol saw ngawl anluum bek kine tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Poaikhaam a ni masabel ni in, biakna vawt tu in na kikhawm tu uh a, na kiseam ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Topa tungah an taw biakpiakna in meihal biakpiakna pia vun: khuitalno nii, tuutal khat le kum khat a pha tuutal sali, a vekpi in a mealhem ngawl hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Olive thau a kihel anvui taw piak ngei antang biakpiakna pia vun: Khuital khat ciang anvui kilogramme 3 veu, tuutal sia anvui kilogramme 2
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />le tuutalno khat ciang anvui kilogramme khat veu taw pia tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mawphel biakpiakna in keal tal khat zongh pia vun a, hi bangin mipite atu in a zeksa thiansuana vawt vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hite sia zing simin meihal biakpiakna belapna in pia vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuabang ma in ni sali sung ama a lungkimsak ngimnam, an taw biakpiakna Topa tungah pia vun. Hi biakpiakna sia ni sim meihal biakpiakna le sapittui biakpiakna belapna in pia thua vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A ni sali ni in, biakna vawt tu in kikhawm vun a, na seam heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Anlaak Poai a ni masabel ni in Topa tungah anpal biakpiakna na piak uh ciang biak kikhopna nei in, bangma seam ngawl tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Topa a lungkimsak ngimnam, meihal biakpiakna pia vun: khuital moi nii, tuutal khat le kum khat a pha tuutalno sali hi tu a, a vekpi in a mealhem ngawl hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Olive thau le anvui a kihel piak ngengei antang biakpiakna pia vun: khuital khat ciang anvui kilogramme 3 veu, tuutal sia anvui kilogramme 2,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />le tuutalno khat ciang anvui kilogramme khat veu taw pia vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Mawphel biakpiakna in kealtal khat zongh pia vun a, hi bangin mipite atu in a zeksa thiansuana vawt vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ni sim meihal biakpiakna le antang biakpiakna belapna in hite le sapittui biakpiakna pia vun.
  </para>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tha salina a ni khat ni in, biak kikhopna na nei tu uh a, na naseam buatu uh hi. Tua ni in lemle kitum tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa a lungkimsak ngimnam ahi meihal biakpiakna khat Topa pia vun: khuital moi khat, tuutal khat, kum khat a pha tuutalno sali hi tu a, a vekpi in mealhem ngawl hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Olive thau le anvui a kihel piak ngei antang biakpiakna pia vun: khuital khat le anvui kilogramme 3, tuutal khat le kilogramme 2,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />le tuuno khat sim le kilogramme khat veu taw pia vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mawphel biakpiakna in kealtal khat zongh pia vun a, hi bangin mipite atu a zeksa thiansuana vawt vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hi biakpiaknate tha sim a ni khat ni in piak ngengei meihal biakpiakna le antang biakpiakna, ni sim meihal biakpiakna le antang biakpiakna le sapittui biakpiaknate belapna in pia vun. Hi an taw biakpiaknate sia Topa a lungkimsak ngimnam khat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tha salina a ni sawm ni in biak kikhopna nei vun; an ne heak vun a, naseam heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa a lungkimsak ngimnam ahi meihal biakpiakna khat Topa tungah pia vun: khuitalno khat, tuutal khat, le kum khat a pha tuutalno sali hi tu a, a vekpi in mealhem ngawl hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Olive thau le anvui kihel ngeina biakpiakna pia vun: khuital sia anvui kilogramme 3, tuutal sia anvui kilogramme 2,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />le tuutalno khat ciang kilogramme khat veu taw pia vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mipite atu a zeksa thiansuana in a kipia keal, le ni sim meihal biakpiakna, antang biakpiakna le sapittui biakpiakna belapna in kealtal khat taw mawphel biakpiakna pia thua vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tha salina a ni sawm le ni nga ni in biak kikhopna nei vun. Topa patoaina in tua poaipi ni sali sung khaamin, naseam heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hi a ni khat ni in Topa a lungkimsak ngimnam ahi an biakpiakna Topa tungah pia vun: khuital no sawm le thum, tuutal nii le kum khat a pha tuutal no sawm le li hi tu a, a vekpi in mealhem ngawl hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Olive thau le anvui a kihel ngeina antang biakpiakna pia vun: khuital khat ciang anvui kilogramme 3 veu, tuutal khat ciang kilogramme 2 veu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />le tuutalno khat ciang kilogramme khat veu, a kisamh za sapittui biakpiaknate taw pia vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mawphel biakpiakna in kealtal khat zongh pia vun. Hi biakpiaknate ni sim meihal biakpiakna, antang biakpiakna le sapittui biakpiakna belapna in pia thua vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A ni nii ni in, a mealhem ngawl khuital no sawm le nii, tuutal nii le kum khat a pha tuutal no sawm le li pia vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuate taw a ni khat ni atu a, a kisamh biakpiakna dang theampo pia khawm vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A ni thum ni in, a mealhem ngawl khuital no sawm le khat, tuutal nii, le kum khat a pha tuutalno sawm le li pia vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuate taw a ni khat ni atu a kisamh biakpiakna dangte theampo pia khawm vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ani li ni in, a mealhem ngawl khuital moi sawm, tuutal nii, le kum khat a pha tuutalno sawm le li pia vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuate taw a ni khat ni atu, a kisamh biakpiakna dang theampo pia khawm vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ani nga ni in a mealhem ngawl khuital no kua, tuutal nii, kum khat a pha tuutalno sawm le li pia vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuate taw a ni khat ni atu a kisamh biakpiakna dang theampo pia khawm vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ani luk ni in, a mealhem ngawl khuital no liat, tuutal nii, le kum khat a pha tuutalno sawm le li pia vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuate taw a ni khat ni atu in a kisamh biakpiakna dang theampo pia khawm vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ani sali ni in, a mealhem ngawl khuital sali, tuutal nii, le kum khat a pha tuutalno sawm le li pia vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tuate taw a ni khat ni atu a kisamh biakpiakna dang theampo pia khawm vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ani liat ni in, biak kikhopna nei vun a, na seam heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Topa a lungkimsak ngimnam ahi an biakpiakna khat in Topa tungah meihal biakpiakna pia vun: khuital no khat, tuutal khat, le kum khat a pha tuutalno sali, a mealhem ngawl hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tuate taw a ni khat ni atu a kisamh biakpiakna dang theampo taw pia khawm vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Hite sia, vawt tu a kisee poaite ah Topa tungah na sep tu meihal biakpiakna, antang biakpiakna, sapittui biakpiakna le pawlkhop biakpiaknate taw kisai zui tu ngeinate ahi hi. Hite sia kiciamna khat taangtutsakna ahibuale thinzaw biakpiaknate in na piak biakpiaknate belapna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tuabangin Moses in ama tungah Topa thupiak sa theampo Israel mite tungah son hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Moses in Israel minamte ii lampuite tungah a nuai a zui tu hilnate pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pasal khat in Topa tungah na khat piak tu in kam kiciamna khat a vawt ciang ahibuale na khat pawpo ten tu in kiciamna a vawt ciang ama in ciam peal ngawl tu a, a ci theampo taangtungsak hamtang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A pa inn ah a om lai ngaknu khat in Topa tungah na khat piak tu in kamkiciamna khat a vawt ciang ahibuale bang ziam khat ten tu in kamciam a piak ciang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />tua sia a pa in a zaak ciang a nial buanale, tua a kamkiciamna ahibuale a kamciamna taangtungsak hamtang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahizong a kamkiciamna sia a pa in a zaak ciang, a khaam le ama in tuasia taangtunsak kul nawn ngawl hi. A kamciam bang a sep tu a pa in oai ngawl ahikom Topa in maisak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pasal nei ngawl lai ngaknu khat in a thin takpi taw, ahibuale ngaisun phot ngawlin na khat ten tu in kamciamna a vawt zawkciang pasal a nei le
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />tua thu a pasal in a zaak ciang a khaam buale, a kamkiciamna ahibuale a kamciam theampo ama in seam nanak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahizong a pasal in tua kamkiciamna a zaak ciang a sep tu a khaam le ama in tuasia taangtutsak kul ngawl hi. Topa in ama maisak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Meingong khat ahibuale a pasal ii khul numei khat in kamkiciamna a vawt theampo le na khat ten tu in kamciamna a vawt theampo taangtungsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pasal a nei numei khat in kamkiciamna khat vawt a, ahibuale na khat ten tu in kamciamna a vawt le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />a pasal in tua thu a zaak ciang a khaam buanale ama kamkiciamna ahibuale a kamciam theampo taangtungsak nanak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahizong a pasal in tua thu a zaak ciang, a sep tu a khaam le ama in a kamkiciamna bang sep kul ngawl hi. A pasal in ama kamkiciamna bang a sep tu khaam ahikom Topa in ama maisak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A pasal in a zi kamkiciamna ahibuale a kamciam khosak natu ahizong, phiat natu ahizong thu nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahizong a pasal in a zi ii kamkiciamna a zaak ni in a khaam buale a kamkiciamna bangin a zi in seam tu hi. A zaak ni in khaam ngawl ahikom a lungkimpui sa suak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahizong ama in tua kamkiciamna sia a zawk pek ciang a phiatsak kik pheang le, tuasia a taangtut ngawl hu in thupiang teng ama in thuak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hi thute pasal nei numei ahibuale, pasal nei ngawlin a pa inn ah a om lai ngaknu khat ii kam kiciamnate taw kisai in, Topa ii Moses tungah a piak zui tu ngeinate ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Israel mite tungah a vawtna hangin Midian te daan pia in. Tuasia na sep zawkciang thi tu ni hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ahiciang Moses in mipite tungah, “ Topa tungah a vawtnate hangin Midian te sim a daan a pia thei tu in ngalsim tu kinging vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Israel ii nam sim pan pasal tulkhat tek ngalsim tu in kuansak vun,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaciang Israel ii nam khat sim pan pasal tulkhat tek kiteal a, a vekpi in tulsawm le tulnii ngalsim tu in kithoai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Moses in thiampi Eleazar tapa, van thiangthote le thu kikona lemle a keam pa Phinehas in uksakin amate kuansak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah a thupiak bangin amate in Midian te simin, pa theampo that siat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuate sungah Midian kumpi ngate: Evi, Rekem, Zur, Hur, le Reba kihel hi. Amate in Beor tapa Balaam zongh thatlum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Israel mite in Midian numeite le patangte manin, a khuite le a ngannote, a nei a lamh theampo sut a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />a ngiaphual le a khuapi theampo halsak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amate ii a sutol nate theampo, a ngalmatte le a nganno teng zongh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Jericho pan Jordan ngunngal khat Moab zaangtam ah ngiaphual a saat Moses, Eleazar le Israel taangpi bup omna ah paipui uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Moses, Eleazar le taangpi lampui dang theampo in ngalkaphonpi muak tu in ngiaphual pan pai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Moses sia ngalsimna pan hong heak kik ngalkap bu teng, tulkhat a ukte le zakhat a ukte tungah thin uuk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Moses in amate tungah, “Banghang numei theampo hing khoai nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Balaam thu zui in Peor ah mipite Topa mai ah thumaan ngawl a suaksak sia, hi numeite ahi hunlam phawk vun. Tuasia in Topa ii mihonte tungah natsia a kizelsak sia ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ahiciang, tu in pano teng le pa taw a khial ngeisa numei teng thatlum vun a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />ahizong ngaknuno teng le numei thiangtho theampo noma atu in khoaikhe vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tu in mihing a that peuma le mithiluang a tham peuma, ni sali sung ngiaphual pua sangah om tu nu hi. A ni thum ni le ni sali ni in noma le na mat uh numeite kithiansua vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Note in puanbek theampo, savun, kealmul ahibuale thing taw kivawt nate theampo thiansua hamtang tu nu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Thiampi Eleazar in ngalsimna pan hong heakkikte tungah, “Hite sia Topa ii Moses tungah a piaksa zui tu ngeinate ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mei ii a kak ngawl tute, khamh, ngunn, taau, thik, daan le haak ci bangte mei sung kaantansakin kithiansua tu hi. Nadang teng ahile thiansuana tui taw in kithiansua tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ani sali ni in na puante sawp vun a, tuaciang note biakna taw kisai a thiang in ngiaphual sungah hong kitumsak tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Nangma le Eleazar in taangpi lampuite taw kopin ngal sungah ngalmatte le ngannote a kipan a kiman theampo sim siat tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua te a kikim in khen nii sua vun a, khen khat sia ngalkapte atu le khen dang khat sia a taanglai taangpite atu hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ngalkapte ii khen sung pan ngalmat za nga ciang khat veu Topa atu phiangshia in la vun, khui, laa, tuu le keal te zongh tuabang ma in la vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Topa tung a kituam piak tu te thiampi Eleazar tungah pia vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A taanglai mipite ii khen sung pan ngalmat sawmnga ciang khat la in a, khui, laa, tuu le keal zongh tuabang ma in la vun. Tuate Topa Puanbuk uk Levi mite pia vun,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Topa thupiak bangin Moses le Eleazar in seam uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A nuai a teng sia ngalkapte ii mat te hi a, amate atu in a kep tuam banah a kibelap teng ahi hi. Tuu le keal 675,000, khui 72,000, laa 61,000, numei thiangtho 32,000 ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Hite sung pan a lang ngalkapte ii a tel sia; tuu le keal 337,500 hi a tuasung pan Topa tungah phiangshia in a kipia 675 hi; ngalkapte atu in khui 36,000 hi a, tuate sung pan Topa tungah phiangshia in a kipia 72 hi; Ngalkapte atu in laa 30,500 hi a, tuate sung pan Topa tungah phiangshia in a kipia 61 hi; ngalkapte atu in numei thiangtho 16,000 hi a, tuate sung pan Topa tungah phiangshia in a piak 32 ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tuaciang Topa thupiakna bangin Topa a kipia tuam phiangshia sia Moses in Eleazar tungah pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Taangpi taangtate ii tel sia ngalkapte a bangma hi a: tuu le keal 337,500, khui 36,000, laa 30,500 le ngaknu thiangtho 16,000 ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Hi tel sung pan Topa thupiakna bangin ngalmatte le ngannote sawmnga ciang khat Moses in la phot a, Topa Puanbuk a uk Levi mite tungah pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tuaciang ngalkaphonpi a uk bute sia Moses kungah pai in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />thupuak a, “Topa awng, kote khutnuai a om ngalkapte ka sim siat uh a khat zongh kisamh ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Tua hi a, kote tek ii ka laak sa uh khamh taw kivawt kizepnate, baanbulte, haakte, khutzungbute, bilbaate le khite kong paipui uh hi. Kote nuntakna hong kep bit natu in hi vanhte Topa tungah kote nuntakna kitatna in ka pia uh hi.” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Moses le Eleazar in khamh taw kivawt tua kizepnate theampo saang uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Ngalkap bute ii a piak teng a kingawm ciang kilogramme 200 dektak ngit hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Ngalkapbu ahi ngawlte in amate ii mat vanh tek keam uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Tua ahiciang Topa in Israel mite a kepcing natu in Moses le Eleazar in khamh teng Puanbuk sungah paipui in sot uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Reuben le Gad namte in nganno tam mama nei uh hi. A ngannote atu in Jazer le Gilead ngam le lei bangza pha ci in a mu ciang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Moses, Eleazar le taangpi lampui dangte kungah amate pai in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“ Topa huna taw Israel te ii laksa hi khuate — Ataroth, Dibon, Jazer, Nimrah, Heshbon, Elealeh, Sibmah, Nebo le Beon khuate — nganno khoai natu in pha a, nganno tam mama ka nei uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nong hesuakna in hi ngam le lei kote hong pia tavun a, tualai ngun ngalkhat ah a teang tu in Jordan Ngun hong kaantansak heak vun,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Moses in, “Na Israel mipuite ngalsimin a kuan laitak note hi lai ah om nuam nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa in amate a piaksa ngam sungah a tum tu Israel mite ii Jordan ngun a kaantan tu sia, bang bang thinkiamsak ngam zen nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuasia in na pate Kadesh Barnea pan ngamvil tu ka paisak lai in a ngamtat uh bang keak ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amate Eshkol Kuam dongah pai in tua ngam mu uh a, ahizong a heak kik ciang Topa piaksa ngam ah Israel te a tum nop ngawl natu in a thin kiamsak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ni in Topa thin uukin kamciam khat pia hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />‘Kei tungah hong thumaan tan ngawl ahikom, Egypt ngam pan a pusuak mite sung pan kum kul pan a tungsia pa a minpiang kuama Abraham, Isaac le Jacob tungah ka khapsa Canaan ngam tum ngawl tu hi, ci in kiciamna ka vawt hi.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hi sungah Keniz mi, Jephunneh tapa Caleb le Nun tapa Joshua simngawl, a dang teng kihel siat hi: amate hile Topa tungah thumaanna nei uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mite tungah Topa thin uuk a, ama a lungkimsak ngawlte a khang buppi in a thi siat dong, duisung ngampa ah kum sawmli sung vakthapsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tu in, mawnei khangthak note in na pate dinmun la in, Israel tungah a nasia mama Topa thin uukna thengsak kik tu in kithoai nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tu in no Reuben le Gad mite in Topa nungzui tu na nial uh le ama in hi mipi theampo duisung ah khatvei ma nusia kik tu a, amate a lalsak sia noma na hi tu uh hi,” ci in zo kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amate Moses kungah pai in, “A masa in, hi lai ah ka tuute atu in suang taw doituamte hong uumsak ta'n a, ko hong bealhte atu in a ki uum khuapite hong sasak ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuasia ciang ko sia Israel mipuite taw ngalsimin a kuankhawm tu le, amate lua tu ngam le lei ah ka teensak zawk mateng in, koma lampui in a sim tu ka kinging tu uh hi. Tua hun sungin ko hong bealhte in hilai a ki uum khuapite sungah teang thei tu uh a, hi ngammite panin ngammuangin om tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Israel dangte theampo in a nga tu ngam teng a laak zawk mateng in, ka cia buatu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kote in hi lai Jordan nisuana sangah tel nga zo ka hi uh kom Jordan langkhat amate sungah tel dang ka la buatu uh hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Moses in, “Na ci uh sia a takpi ahile hi lai Topa mai ah ngalsim tu in kithoai paih vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na ngalkapte theampo in Jordan ngun kaantan in, Topa thupiakna nuai ah, Topa in ngalte a zaw mateng,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />le ngam le lei a laak zawk mateng ih ngalte sim tu uh hi. Tuasia zawkciang Topa tung le Israel mipuite sungah na vaipuak teng zo siat zo tu na hikom na cia thei tu uh hi. Tua zawkciang Topa in hi Jordan nisuana ngam sia note aa hi ci in hong tepteesak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ahizong, na kamciam na len bua uh le, Topa langpanin mawnei na hi tu uh sia kong hesak hi. Hi thu taw kisai in khial tha heak vun; na mawna daan thuak tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua ahiciang khuapite le na tuute atu in doituamte na vawt vun, ahihang na kamciamsa uh bangin vawt vun!” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Gad le Reuben mite in, “Topa awng, nong thupiakna bangin ka seam tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ka zite, ka tate, ka khui le ka tuute hi lai Gilead khuapite ah ka nusia tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ahizong kote theampo Topa thupiakna nuai ah ngalsim tu in ka kinging uh hi. Nangma ci bangin kote Jordan kaantan in ngal ka sim tu uh hi.” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua ahiciang Moses in Eleazar, Joshua le Israel lampui dangte tungah hi bang thupia hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Gad le Reuben mite in Jordan kaantan in Topa thupiakna taw ngalsim tu in kinging a, amate huna taw note in ngam na la zo uh le, Gilead ngam sia amate atu in pia vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ahizong amate in Jordan kan ngawlin, ngal hong simpui buale, noma bangin Canaan ngam ah amate ii tel nga tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Gad le Reuben mite in, “Topa awng, Topa thupiak bangin ka seam tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Kote in hi lai Jordan nisuana mun ka neisa ka nga kik thei natu uh in ama thupiakna nuai ah Canaan ngam kaantan in ngal ka sim tu uh hi,” ci in zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tua ahiciang, Moses in Amor Kumpi Sihon, le Bashan Kumpi Og ngam theampo le a kiim a paam khua le ngamte Gad le Reuben namte tung le Manasseh ii nam a khenlang tungah ngam khen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Gad namte in a ki uumcip khuapite ahi Dibon, Ataroth, Aroer,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Atroth Shophan, Jazer, Jogbehah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Beth Nimrah le Beth Haran khuate luphung ciang kik uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Reuben namte in Heshbon, Elealeh, Kiriathaim,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Nebo, Baal Meon (Hi min sia kilaih zo), le Sibmah khuate sa kik uh hi. Amate in a sakkik uh khuate minthak pia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Manasseh tapa Machir bee le phung in Gilead ngam simin a laak zawkciang tua ngam ah a teang Amor te hawlkeak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tua ahiciang Moses in Gilead ngam sia Machir bee le phungte pia a, tualai ah amate teang uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Manasseh nam Jair in khuano pawlkhat simin la a, “Jair Khuanote” ci in a min vaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Nobah in Kenath le a kiim a khuanote simin la a, ama min tapin Nobah ci in min phuak kik hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Moses le Aaron lampuina taw Israel te, Egypt ngam pan amate nam tek ii lampuina nuai ah a pusua zawk uh ciang a ngiaphual saatna mun minte sia a nuai a bang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa thupiakna bangin, Moses in ngiaphual a saat simin a mun min veu ciamtee hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Paisan Poai masabel a zing ciang, tua kum tha masabel ni sawm le ni nga ni in Israel mite in Egypt ngam nusia uh hi. Topa kepna taw amate Rameses khuapi pan in
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa ii a thalup a tapaciilte phumin a om Egypt mite mu tangin amate in paisan uh hi. Hi bangin a sepna taw Topa in Egypt pathiante sangin vaanglian zaw a hina lak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Israel mite Rameses nusia in Sukkoth ah ngiaphual saat uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A ngiaphual kik sia sennealngammong Etham ah saat uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua mun pan amate, Baal Zephon nisuana, Pi Hahiroth ah heak kikin Migdol nai ah ngiaphual saat uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amate Pi Hahiroth nusia in, San Tuipi kaantan in Shur sennealngamsung theng uh hi; ni thum sung a pai zawk uh ciang Marah ah ngiaphual saat uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua mun pan Elim ah pai in ngiaphual saat uh hi, banghang ziam cile tualai ah ciktui sawm le nii le palm kung 70 om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amate Elim nusia in, Suez Tuipidok paam ah ngiaphual saat uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A ngiaphual kik sia Sin sennealngam sungah saat uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaciang Dophkah ah ngiaphual saatin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />tua zawkciang Alush ah saat uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A ngiaphual kik sia Rephidim hi a, tualai ah amate neak tu tui om ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amate in Rephidim pan Hor Mual dong a nuai a mun tengah ngiaphual saat uh hi: Sinai Sennealngam, Kibroth Hattaavah (ahibuale Longthakte Thaante), Hazeroth, Rithmah, Rimmon Perez, Libnah, Rissah, Kehelathah, Shepher Mual, Haradah, Makheloth, Tahath, Terah, Mithkah, Hashmonah, Moseroth, Bene Jaakan, Hor Haggidgad, Jotbathah, Abronah, Eziongeber, Zin duisung (Kadesh), le Edom ngammong Hor Mual ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Topa thupiak bangin thiampi Aaron sia Hor Mual ah kaato hi. Israel te Egypt a nusiat zawk kum sawm li, a tha ngana, ni khat ni, ama kum 123 a phak ciang tua munah thi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Canaan thangsang Arad ngam kumpipa in Israel te hong paina thu za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Hor Mual pan Moab zaangtam dong a nuai a mun tengah Israel te in ngiaphual saat uh hi: Zalmonah, Punon, Oboth, Moab ngamsung a lalsa Abarim, Dibon Gad, Almon Diblathaim, Nibo Mual hui Abarim Mualte le Beth Jeshimoth le Acacia Kuam kilaklaw, Jericho pan Jordan Ngun ngalkhat Moab zaangtam te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Jericho pan Jordan ngunngal khat Moab zaangtam ah Topa in Moses tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Israel atu in a nuai a hilnate pia hi: “Jordan ngun kaanin Canaan ngam na tum uh ciang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />ngam sungah a teangte theampo notkeak nanak tu nu hi. Amate ii suang le leisung sumpiang taw a vawt milim theampo le a biakna mun theampo susia vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />A ngam la in, tua munah teang vun, banghang ziam cile tua sia note kong pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Namte le bee le phung tuatuam sungah lai meetang sawkin ngam hawm vun, bee le phung tamte sia ngamzai pia in, bee le phung tawmte sia ngamno pia vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Ahizong ngam sungah a teangte na notkeak bua uh ahile a taanglaite in note mit a tangsak ninnengte bang le na pangh hong sun lingte bangin hong nawngkaisak tu a, amate in note hong do tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Amate na notkeak bua uh ahile, amate lalcipsak tu ka sawm bangin note kong lalcipsak tu hi.” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel mite atu in a nuai a hilnate pia hi: “Keima kong piak Canaan ngamsung na tum uh ciang na ngamngi uhte a nuai a bang hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thangsang ngamngi sia Zin duisung pan kipan tu a, Edom ngamngi dung zui in pai tu hi. Nisuana sang ngamngi sia Tuipi Thi thangsang mong pan kipan tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuaciang thangsang zuan in Akrabbim Mualciangh sangah kotin Zin kaantan suak tu a, thangsang Kadesh Barnea dong kipee hi. Tuaciang nitumna saksang zuan in Hazar Addar ah paito a, Azmon dong hi tu hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />tua mun pan Egypt ngamngi kuam sangah kot tu a, Mediterranean ah tawp tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Nitumna sang ngamngi sia Mediterranean Tuipi hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Saksang ngamngi sia Mediterranean pan Hor Mual dong kithung tu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />tua mun pan Hamath Mualciangh dong hi tu hi. Tuasia Zedad le
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ziphron dong paisuak in Hazar Enan ah tawp tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Nisuana sang ngamngi sia Hazar Enan pan Shepham dong kithung tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuasia Ain ii nisuana, thangsang ah a om Harbel ah pai tu a, Galilee Tuili vaalbo nisuana sang mualte tungah pai in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />tuaciang Jordan ngun zui in thangsang Tuipi Thi dong hi tu hi. Hite sia na ngam king li ii ngamngi hi tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ahiciang Moses in Israel te tungah, “Hi ngam sia Topa in nam kua le langte tungah a piak ngam hi a, lai meetang sawkin na nga tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Reuben le Gad namte le nisuana sang Manasseh nam a khenlangte in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Jordan ngun langkhat nisuana sang Jericho ngalkhat ah amate innkuante taw kizui in ngam hawm siat zo uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Thiampi Eleazar le Nun tapa Joshua in mipite atu in ngam hawmsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ngam hawmna ah amate hu tu in, a nam sim pan lampui khat veu teal in,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hite sia Topa ii teal mite hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hi mite sia Canaan ngam ah Israel mite atu neisa hawm tu in Topa sawlte ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jericho khua pan Jordan ngun ngalkhat Moab zaangtam ah Topa in Moses tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Israel te ii a nga a neisate sung pan Levi te teen natu in khuapi pawlkhat le a khuapite kiimkot ah ngan tha natu leitang a piak nanak tu in son in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hi khuapite Levi te neisa hi tu a, tua munah amate teang tu uh hi. Tua nganthana mun sia a khui le a nganno dangte theampo atu hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nganthana mun sia khuapi luphungte pan a kiimkot metre 450 veu zai tu hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua hile ngantha natu sia khuapi kiimkot teng hi a, a pangh kikim kiing li nei, a pangh khat metre 900 veu zai tu a, a laizang ah khuapi om tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Levi te tungah bukna khuapi luk na pia tu uh a, mi khat pawpo in mihing khat a that tha le a buk natu hi tu hi. Tuasia belapna in a dang khuapi sawmli le nii zongh a nganthana taw kop in amate pia thua vun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />a vekpi in sawmli le liat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A nam khat sim ii sungah Levi te ii khuapi phaza tu sia, a ngam letna taw kizui in kikhensat tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Israel mite a sonsawn tu in thupia a: “Jordan Ngun kaanin Canaan ngamsung na tum uh ciang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />ngaisut khol ngawlin mi khat in ngual a that tha le ama suatak thei natu in a buk natu khuapite teal tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua munah mithi pa mealheak a phula nuam sia ii khut sung pan suakta tu hi. Mihing that hi ci in a kimawsak pa sia mipi mai ah thu a kikhensat mateng kithat ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khuapi luk,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jordan nisuana sangah thum le Canaan ngam sungah thum teal vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hi khuapi luk te sia Israel mite le tawmvei sung ahizong a tawntung ahizong a teang ngamdangmite atu in bukna hi tu hi. Ngaisut khol ngawlin mi khat a that tha pawpo in tua khuapi khat pawpo zuan thei tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Ahihang mihing khat in thik, suang ahibuale moltawng zanghin ngual khat a that le, ama sia mihing that mawna nei a kithatlum tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Thalup a thuak pa ii a mealheak kinai puibel sia in tua mi that pa a thalup tu vaipuak nei hi. Tua mi that pa a mu po ciang ama in that tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Mihing khat in ngual khat ngaimaw in sawnvawk ahibuale bang khat po taw deangin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />ahibuale a khuttum taw thongin a that le ama sia mihing that mawna nei a, kithatlum tu hi. Thalup a thuakpa ii a mealheak kinaipuibel sia in mi that pa a thalup tu vaipuak nei hi. Tua pa a mu ciang ama in that tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Ahizong sonteena in mihing khat in a ngaimawk ngawl ngual khat po sawnvawk a, ahibuale bang khat po taw deang in that tha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ahibuale a liamsua nuam hi ngawl, a ngal zongh hi ngawl napi khua en ngawlin a suang den khat taw midang khat kha in that tha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuabang thute ah taangpite in a thi sia ii bee pa, a phula nuam sia pa panpui ngawlin mihing a thisak pa panpui in thukhen tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Taangpite in mihing that mawna nei pa sia, mithi pa beete kung pan ama suatakna a bukna khuapi ah heak kiksak tu hi. Thiampi Lianbelpa ii thi dong tualai a bukna khuapi ah ama teang nanak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mihing that mawna nei pa sia a suatakna a bukna khuapi nusia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />tuaciang mithi pa ii beepa in mu in a thatlum le hi phulaakna sia mi that hi ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Mihing that mawna nei pa sia a bukna khuapi ah Thiampi Lianbelpa thi dong teang hamtang lai tu a, ahizong tuasia zawkciang cia thei tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hi ngeinate na teenna mun po ah nangma le na suan na paalte ii zui tu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />“Mihing that in, a kimawsiat pa sia a mu tetti nii, ahibuale tetti a tamzaw a om ciang bekin mawnei hi ci in kithatlum thei bek tu hi: tetti khat bek sia mi that hi ci in kimawsiat natu in kicing ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Mihing that pa sia kithatlum tu hi. Ama mawna daan pan a suatak natu in sum taw kitan thei ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Bukna khuapi ah tai in a buu sa khat sia Thiampi Lianbelpa thi ma in, inn ah a ciakik natu in kitansak heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Na kitansak uh le na teenna ngam le lei a ninsak hi tu nu hi. Mihing thalupna in ngam le lei ninsak a, biakna taw kisai in mihing khat kithalupna mun thiansua natu in mi that sia pa ii a thi tu ngawl buang thudang om ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Na teenna ngam le lei ninsak heak vun, banghang ziam cile Keima in Topa ka hi a, Israel mite sungah ka teang hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Joseph ii tapa ahi Manasseh ii tupa, Machir ii tapa le Gilead bee le phung sung innkuan lutang teng sia, Moses le lampui dangte kungah pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amate in, “ Topa in ngam le lei Israel mite tungah lai meetang sawk a hawmsak tu in note thu hong pia hi. Ama in no tungah ka suapuipa uh Zelophehad ii neisa teng a tanute piak natu in thu hong pia si hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahizong a tanute in nam dang taw a kiteang le, a neisate tua nam dangte neisa suak tu a, ko ii nga tu theampo kikhiam tu ahi sia phawk vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kipiak kikna Jubilee kumin, a kizuaksa theampo a nei ciilte tungah a kipiak kik ciang, Zelophehad tanute neisa sia a teenna nam ii neisa belapna hi paisuak tu a, ko nam ii supna hi tu hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ahiciang Moses in Israel mite tungah Topa ii Thupiak om bangin thupia sawn hi. Ama in, “Manasseh namte ii a ci teng maan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ahiciang Topa in Zelophehad tanute in a dei po teenpui thei tu hi, ahizong amate nam sung pan bek hi tu hi, ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Israel mi peuma ii neisate ama ii nam sungah kip tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Israel nam khat sungah ngamhlua numei peuma in tua nam sung pan pasal khat teenpui hamtang tu hi. Tu a bangin Israel mikim in a taanghpupite neisa teng lua tu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />nei le lam sia minam khat pan nam dang khat tung theng ngawl tu hi. A neisate a nam tek in neisuak tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ahiciang Zelophehad tanute, Mahlah, Tirzah, Hoglah, Milcah le Noah te in Moses tungah Topa thupiak bangin a suapui sealhte teenpui uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amate in Joseph tapa Manasseh nam ii bee le phungte taw kiteang uh a, a neisate a pa ii nam sungah kip hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hite sia Jericho khua pan Jordan Ngun ngalkhat Moab zaangtam ah Topa ii Moses tungtawnin a piak Israel mite zui tu ngeinate ahi hi.
  </para>
</usx>
